# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "DRYER"
msgstr "SÈCHE-LINGE"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/4/b/1
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You darken my lint-screen? How jejune..."
msgstr "Tu viens assombrir mon filtre à peluches ? Quelle puérilité..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well how do you do? I'm just stretching, you know, luxuriating, being ME in general."
msgstr "Eh bien, comment vas-tu ? Moi, je m'étire, tu vois, je me prélasse, je suis MOI en général."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/18
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But it looks to me, oh fresh and curious one, that you've got a question for me!"
msgstr "Mais il me semble, ô être frais et curieux, que tu as une question à me poser !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/26/b/1
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "At least, I would have a question if I were wearing such a Fantastic Red Shirt!"
msgstr "Du moins, j'en aurais une si je portais une aussi Fantastique Chemise Rouge !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, Stepford needs your help..."
msgstr "Ouais, Stepford a besoin de ton aide..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I love being asked questions... especially about a little snack like Stepford."
msgstr "J'adore qu'on me pose des questions... surtout au sujet d'un petit en-cas comme Stepford."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I absolutely love the proof positive that those around me are fascinated to distraction by my every thought!"
msgstr "J'adore cette preuve irréfutable que mon entourage est fasciné à en perdre la tête par chacune de mes pensées !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/16/b/4
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "Dear Drydee, do you really need more evidence that you're fascinating?"
msgstr "Cher Drydee, as-tu vraiment besoin de preuves supplémentaires que tu es fascinant ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/16/b/12
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "You're already putting a foot on the road that leads us to miscommunication and disaster!"
msgstr "Tu as déjà un pied sur la route qui mène au malentendu et au désastre !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/16/b/20
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "No! Oh Washee, my darling... no miscommunication here."
msgstr "Non ! Oh, Washee, mon chéri... pas de malentendu ici."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/16/b/31
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Come come now, you know me. I am a little flirt. I love to talk. Our friend has some questions for me!"
msgstr "Allons allons, tu me connais. Je suis un petit charmeur. J'adore parler. Notre ami a des questions pour moi !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/16/b/39
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Surely you must know that there is no one extant who could ever... who will ever replace you."
msgstr "Tu sais sûrement qu'il n'existe personne qui pourrait jamais... qui pourra jamais te remplacer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/16/b/47
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "Of course I know."
msgstr "Bien sûr que je le sais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/16/b/55
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "You are a flirt the same way that I am a poet."
msgstr "Tu es un charmeur comme je suis un poète."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/16/b/63
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "We must both, I suppose, try not to get carried away."
msgstr "Nous devons tous deux, je suppose, tâcher de ne pas nous emballer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/16/b/71
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "He means he loves me, I think."
msgstr "Il veut dire qu'il m'aime, je crois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/16/b/79
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Isn't that sweet?"
msgstr "N'est-ce pas adorable ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/16/b/90
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "And by that, he means that he loves me. Aren't we a funny little pair?"
msgstr "Et par là, il veut dire qu'il m'aime. Quel drôle de petit duo nous formons !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/16/b/98
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "I'll leave you to it, then!"
msgstr "Je vous laisse, alors !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I need a fact about dryers."
msgstr "Il me faut un fait sur les sèche-linge."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ah yes. Well. Is it dryers in general you want to know about or me in particular?"
msgstr "Ah oui. Eh bien. Les sèche-linge en général, ou moi en particulier ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Because if it's me in particular, we're going to be here all night!"
msgstr "Parce que si c'est moi en particulier, on y est jusqu'à la nuit !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, dryers in general, actually."
msgstr "Non, les sèche-linge en général, en fait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ah. Then it'll be shorter... but still riveting because I'm a dryer and therefore there must be something inherently wonderful about dryers as a general concept."
msgstr "Ah. Alors ce sera plus court... mais toujours passionnant, parce que je suis un sèche-linge et qu'il doit donc y avoir quelque chose d'intrinsèquement merveilleux dans le concept même de sèche-linge."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Hm... let me think..."
msgstr "Hm... laisse-moi réfléchir..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I must give you the best fact I can think of...."
msgstr "Je dois te donner le meilleur fait auquel je puisse penser...."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/31
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ooh! Got it. And since I'm not only fascinating but humorous, I present my fact to you in the form of a riddle."
msgstr "Ooh ! Trouvé. Et comme je ne suis pas seulement fascinant mais aussi drôle, je te le présente sous forme de devinette."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/42
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Why do dryers produce static electricity?"
msgstr "Pourquoi les sèche-linge produisent-ils de l'électricité statique ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because there're lots of little electricity elves living in the lint filters!"
msgstr "Parce qu'il y a plein de petits lutins électriques qui vivent dans les filtres à peluches !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They don't. Static electricity is a lie perpetrated by the manufacturers of dryer sheets."
msgstr "Ils n'en produisent pas. L'électricité statique est un mensonge colporté par les fabricants de lingettes assouplissantes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gonna go with... only you produce static because you're that <i>electric</i>."
msgstr "Je vais dire... que toi seul produis de la statique, parce que tu es tellement <i>électrique</i>."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The triboelectric effect."
msgstr "L'effet triboélectrique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Eeeeewww."
msgstr "Beuuurk."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-0/18
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh, no. I can see on another audience how that might've produced an \"Aww\" or a \"how cute\" but from me?"
msgstr "Oh, non. Je vois bien qu'avec un autre public ça aurait pu faire « Aww » ou « trop mignon », mais venant de moi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-0/26
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Blllerrrg, the idea that I'm playing host to a whole society of electricity elves?"
msgstr "Bleeeurg, l'idée que j'héberge toute une société de lutins électriques ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-0/34
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Good lord, what are they doing in there?? Oh now you're going to make me worry about this."
msgstr "Bon sang, mais que font-ils là-dedans ?? Oh, maintenant tu vas me faire m'inquiéter pour ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-0/45
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And no, obviously that is not the answer to my riddle."
msgstr "Et non, évidemment, ce n'est pas la réponse à ma devinette."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Uh-huh... tell me, how is your tin-foil hat fitting these days?"
msgstr "Mmh-mmh... dis-moi, comment va ton chapeau en papier alu ces temps-ci ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Funny you bring that up..."
msgstr "Drôle que tu en parles..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Static electricity, trust me is not a lie. It torments me!"
msgstr "L'électricité statique, crois-moi, n'est pas un mensonge. Elle me tourmente !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Therefore, darling, wrong! That is not the answer to my riddle."
msgstr "Donc, mon ange, faux ! Ce n'est pas la réponse à ma devinette."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ooh. My oh my."
msgstr "Ooh. Mon dieu, mon dieu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-2/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Unfortunately, that is not the answer... but I am sure you know how tempted I am just to give you that one!"
msgstr "Hélas, ce n'est pas la réponse... mais je suis sûr que tu sais à quel point je suis tenté de te la donner pour bonne !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-2/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ahh, flattery is such a constant road to my good graces..."
msgstr "Ahh, la flatterie est un chemin si sûr vers mes bonnes grâces..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-2/34
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But no. I must retain at least a degree of uprightness and commitment to the truth. And so..."
msgstr "Mais non. Je dois conserver au moins un minimum de droiture et d'attachement à la vérité. Et donc..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-2/42
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "...WRONG."
msgstr "...FAUX."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-3/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ah."
msgstr "Ah."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-3/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes, it is indeed... the 'triboelectric effect'."
msgstr "Oui, c'est bien ça... l'« effet triboélectrique »."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-3/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well why in god's name did you come here? To ruin my fun in putting one over on you?"
msgstr "Mais pourquoi diable es-tu venu ici ? Pour gâcher mon plaisir de te faire marcher ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-0/19/c-1/26/c-0/50/c-3/31
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "A good day and a very meaningful 'harumph' to you."
msgstr "Une bonne journée à toi, et un « pfff » des plus significatifs."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "The answer, cherub, is..."
msgstr "La réponse, mon ange, est..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "...the triboelectric effect!"
msgstr "...l'effet triboélectrique !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-2/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The what now?"
msgstr "L'effet quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-2/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh. Yeah. That. I've totally heard of that."
msgstr "Oh. Ouais. Ça. J'en ai totalement entendu parler."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-2/c-3/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Come come cherub, no you haven't."
msgstr "Allons allons, mon ange, non, tu n'en as pas entendu parler."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "The triboelectric effect refers entirely to the electricity generated when two objects rub against each other."
msgstr "L'effet triboélectrique désigne l'électricité produite quand deux objets se frottent l'un contre l'autre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Can you think of anything more perfect to plague me? The friction of contact?"
msgstr "Peux-tu imaginer rien de plus parfait pour me tourmenter ? La friction du contact ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Of course it can happen with many different materials and at differing intensities..."
msgstr "Bien sûr, cela peut se produire avec de nombreux matériaux et à des intensités variables..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "...rubbing your shoes on the carpet will give you a bit of a shock but those damned plastic packing peanuts?"
msgstr "...frotter tes chaussures sur la moquette te donnera une petite décharge, mais ces maudits chips d'emballage en plastique ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "They'll stick to you like they're glued!"
msgstr "Ils te collent dessus comme s'ils étaient collés !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-3/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And anything that's touched you is basically a live wire?"
msgstr "Et tout ce qui t'a touché est en gros un fil sous tension ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-3/c-4/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Mmmmm. Correct, cherub."
msgstr "Mmmmm. Exact, mon ange."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/stepford_drysdale/0/g-3/c-4/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Remember me every time your clothing clings..."
msgstr "Pense à moi chaque fois que tes vêtements te collent à la peau..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "An acrobat in bright orange evaluates you with a smirk. His hair is streaked with gray, and there's a twinkle in his eyes that tells you this guy is definitely going to keep you on your toes."
msgstr "Un acrobate tout en orange vous toise avec un sourire en coin. Ses cheveux sont striés de gris, et une lueur dans son regard vous dit que ce type va sans aucun doute vous tenir en haleine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/17
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well, hello there, new face! I may be quite excited to meet you!"
msgstr "Eh bien, bonjour, nouvelle tête ! Je suis peut-être très excité de te rencontrer !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You may be excited?"
msgstr "Tu es peut-être excité ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Seems like a pretty basic greeting."
msgstr "Plutôt basique, comme salutation."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ahhh is it, though? Am I excited the way I would be about a bratwurst?"
msgstr "Ahhh, vraiment ? Suis-je excité comme je le serais pour une bratwurst ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/c-1/15/b/1
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Or the way I would be about that fantastic red shirt of yours?"
msgstr "Ou comme je le serais pour cette fantastique chemise rouge que tu portes ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Which is different from how I would feel about fireworks, or a sequined codpiece? So much complexity! So when I say \"may\"..."
msgstr "Ce qui est différent de ce que je ressentirais devant un feu d'artifice, ou une braguette à sequins ? Que de complexité ! Alors quand je dis « peut-être »..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I have a voluptuous suspicion that MAY be the emotion I'm experiencing, yes."
msgstr "J'ai le voluptueux soupçon que ce PEUT être l'émotion que je ressens, oui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm excited to meet you, too!"
msgstr "Ça me fait plaisir de te rencontrer aussi !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't know whether or not you're excited to meet me."
msgstr "Tu ne sais même pas si ça t'excite de me rencontrer ou non."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd say be excited. I'm pretty cool."
msgstr "Je dirais : réjouis-toi. Je suis plutôt cool."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ah, but of course you are. How could you not be?"
msgstr "Ah, mais bien sûr que tu l'es. Comment pourrait-il en être autrement ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Look at me, after all! Listen to the mellifluous murmur of my voice."
msgstr "Regarde-moi, après tout ! Écoute le murmure mélodieux de ma voix."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well. Hardly a murmur. Ha HA. More like the euphonious booming of a cannon from a stone-turreted castle!"
msgstr "Enfin. À peine un murmure. Ha HA. Plutôt le grondement euphonique d'un canon sur les remparts d'un château de pierre !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/31
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Marble on all the floors, gold leaf, filigree wrought iron, and my god the velvet."
msgstr "Du marbre sur tous les sols, de la feuille d'or, du fer forgé en filigrane, et, mon dieu, du velours."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/39
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "If I were a castle, I would be absolutely DIPPED in velvet."
msgstr "Si j'étais un château, je serais absolument TREMPÉ dans le velours."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn, your modesty is... impressive."
msgstr "Mince, ta modestie est... impressionnante."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If I were a castle, I think I'd probably have a big-ass moat."
msgstr "Si j'étais un château, je crois que j'aurais probablement des douves énormes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cool. So... can we move on?"
msgstr "Cool. Alors... on peut passer à la suite ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/c-0/11
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "If that was intended as some passive aggressive hint for me to lower my personal volume..."
msgstr "Si c'était une allusion passive-agressive pour que je baisse mon volume personnel..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/c-0/19
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Allow me to adjust myself <i>upward</i> a notch or two."
msgstr "Permets-moi de me régler <i>à la hausse</i> d'un cran ou deux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "A moat, eh? You'd surround yourself with a deep, muddy, deadly river of falsity and needless self-defense?"
msgstr "Des douves, hein ? Tu t'entourerais d'une rivière profonde, boueuse et mortelle de fausseté et d'autodéfense inutile ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Water. The substance that flows like secrecy through the crevices of our lives."
msgstr "L'eau. La substance qui s'écoule comme le secret dans les interstices de nos vies."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Moving on! I do get distracted, don't I? Just so many wonderful things about me on which to expound! My form alone is a temple of wonders."
msgstr "Passons ! Je me laisse distraire, n'est-ce pas ? Il y a tant de choses merveilleuses à mon sujet sur lesquelles disserter ! Ma forme à elle seule est un temple de merveilles."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/g-0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Which... which part is your favorite?"
msgstr "Quelle... quelle partie préfères-tu ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um... of your form?"
msgstr "Euh... de ta forme ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bro."
msgstr "Mec."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He gestures to his muscled frame, inviting you to drink him in."
msgstr "Il désigne sa carrure musclée, vous invitant à vous en abreuver."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/g-0/16/g-0/11
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Which of my parts sings the most to you? For me, today anyway, it's my pectorals."
msgstr "Laquelle de mes parties te parle le plus ? Pour moi, aujourd'hui du moins, ce sont mes pectoraux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/g-0/16/g-0/19
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "They're glistening, enough almost to be felt through the fabric of my tunic!"
msgstr "Ils luisent, au point qu'on les devine presque à travers le tissu de ma tunique !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/g-0/16/g-0/30
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ah! Perhaps this can be the first bridge between us, the first bits of woven lint eventually to form the sturdy braided rope of our friendship."
msgstr "Ah ! Voilà peut-être le premier pont entre nous, les premiers brins de peluche tissés qui formeront un jour la solide corde tressée de notre amitié."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/g-0/16/g-0/38
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Do you, like me, enjoy celebrating at the altar of your own glorious form?"
msgstr "Aimes-tu, comme moi, célébrer à l'autel de ta propre forme glorieuse ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/g-0/16/g-0/46/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you mean working out, then no. Hate it."
msgstr "Si tu parles de faire du sport, alors non. Je déteste ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-0/c-2/47/g-0/16/g-0/46/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The Temple of Tone? Devotee, right here."
msgstr "Le Temple du Tonus ? Fidèle au poste."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well, how can I know for sure? You might turn out to be fabulously interesting in which case, yes, I am thrilled, pass the champagne."
msgstr "Eh bien, comment le savoir avec certitude ? Tu pourrais te révéler d'un intérêt fabuleux, auquel cas oui, je suis ravi, qu'on débouche le champagne."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Or, you might in reality be a dud, a wet blanket, a bore."
msgstr "Ou tu pourrais n'être en réalité qu'une déception, une douche froide, une corvée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_intro/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "...and if that happens and I've already committed to excitement..."
msgstr "...et si cela arrive alors que je me suis déjà engagé dans l'excitation..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_1/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I'd look like a bit of a moron, now, wouldn't I?"
msgstr "J'aurais l'air d'un parfait crétin, n'est-ce pas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_1/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, I guess that makes sense."
msgstr "Ouais, je suppose que c'est logique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_1/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Definitely can't risk looking like a moron."
msgstr "On ne peut vraiment pas risquer d'avoir l'air d'un crétin."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_2/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Of course it makes sense."
msgstr "Bien sûr que c'est logique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_2/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I always make sense."
msgstr "Je suis toujours logique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_2/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I'm a sparkling conversationalist."
msgstr "Je suis un causeur pétillant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_3/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Can't. Shant. Won't! Dignity is key."
msgstr "Impossible. Pas question. Jamais ! La dignité avant tout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "So tell me. Am I excited? Or am I already sorry I asked?"
msgstr "Alors dis-moi. Suis-je excité ? Ou suis-je déjà désolé d'avoir demandé ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And keep in mind. When I'm disappointed, my finely toned trapezii tend to flare unexpectedly."
msgstr "Et garde à l'esprit que lorsque je suis déçu, mes trapèzes finement sculptés ont tendance à se gonfler de façon inattendue."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Those are quite toned..."
msgstr "Ils sont drôlement bien dessinés..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am an exciting person. I think."
msgstr "Je suis quelqu'un d'excitant. Je crois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, excited... I've charmed you right off your feet, haven't I?"
msgstr "Oh, excité... je t'ai fait tomber sous mon charme, n'est-ce pas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Naturally. As an energetic equilibrist I must keep my body in tip-top shape."
msgstr "Naturellement. En tant qu'équilibriste énergique, je dois garder mon corps en pleine forme."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I can see that... you do not make that a priority."
msgstr "Je vois bien que... tu n'en fais pas une priorité."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait but I do!"
msgstr "Attends, mais si !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yup, I sure don't. I hate working out."
msgstr "Ouaip, c'est sûr que non. Je déteste le sport."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You think this, do you? Such adorable self-delusion."
msgstr "Tu crois ça, vraiment ? Quelle adorable illusion."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Such a response gives a whiff of the quotidian."
msgstr "Une telle réponse a comme un parfum de platitude."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You think I'm boring?"
msgstr "Tu me trouves d'un ennui mortel ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not sure what that means..."
msgstr "Je ne vois pas trop ce que ça veut dire..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh that gleam of intelligence in your eye as you understand my big boy word. Shall I tell you a secret?"
msgstr "Oh, cette lueur d'intelligence dans ton regard quand tu comprends mon grand mot. Je te confie un secret ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I think I shall."
msgstr "Je crois que oui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ha! It means \"boring,\" it pains me to say... That word is DEATH, you know."
msgstr "Ha ! Ça veut dire « ennuyeux », hélas... Ce mot, c'est la MORT, tu sais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "That you have. How scintillating to encounter a fellow sophisticate."
msgstr "C'est fait, en effet. Quel plaisir scintillant de croiser un autre esprit raffiné."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-2/21
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Finally someone who is worth sharing even a thread of my personal credo."
msgstr "Enfin quelqu'un qui mérite de partager ne serait-ce qu'un fil de mon credo personnel."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-2/29
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I imagine you'd like to know? My credo?"
msgstr "J'imagine que tu aimerais le connaître ? Mon credo ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-2/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Naturally."
msgstr "Naturellement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-2/37/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm charming enough to know I don't have a choice in the matter."
msgstr "Je suis assez charmant pour savoir que je n'ai pas le choix."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/Intro_4/0/c-2/37/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Touche."
msgstr "Touché."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You HATE the tireless pursuit of physical excellence?"
msgstr "Tu DÉTESTES la quête inlassable de l'excellence physique ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. It's just so boring!"
msgstr "Ouais. C'est tellement ennuyeux !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I just prefer a more functional workout."
msgstr "Non, je préfère juste un entraînement plus fonctionnel."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1a/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "When I come across a new diversion the first question I ask myself is, would a boring person do this."
msgstr "Quand je croise une nouvelle distraction, la première question que je me pose est : une personne ennuyeuse ferait-elle cela ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1a/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "If the answer is yes, I avoid that thing like cheap shoes."
msgstr "Si la réponse est oui, j'évite la chose comme des chaussures bon marché."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1a/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Has this strategy worked for you?"
msgstr "Cette stratégie a-t-elle fonctionné pour toi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1a/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Inexpensive shoes can be just as good.."
msgstr "Les chaussures pas chères peuvent être tout aussi bien.."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1a/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh, I think it has. I met a deeply boring 9-iron once who drank skim milk lattes. I, consequently, and thank god, now only drink full-fatted cappuccinos."
msgstr "Oh, je crois que oui. J'ai croisé un jour un fer 9 profondément ennuyeux qui buvait des lattes au lait écrémé. Du coup, et Dieu merci, je ne bois plus que des cappuccinos au lait entier."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1a/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You could just drink black coffee, you know."
msgstr "Tu pourrais simplement boire du café noir, tu sais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1a/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Personally I've always found the pitching wedge to be the simplest tool."
msgstr "Personnellement, j'ai toujours trouvé que le pitching wedge était l'outil le plus simple."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1a/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Had to one up me, didn't you. Couldn't let my story be good - no, had to put in your own."
msgstr "Il fallait que tu fasses mieux que moi, n'est-ce pas. Tu ne pouvais pas laisser mon histoire être bonne, non, il fallait que tu mettes la tienne."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1a/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was just making conversation. You don't have to be petty."
msgstr "Je faisais juste la conversation. Pas besoin d'être mesquin."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1a/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "'Inexpensive' is not what I mean. I mean, cheaply dreamt of, cheaply designed, cheaply made..."
msgstr "« Pas cher » n'est pas ce que je veux dire. Je parle de choses rêvées au rabais, conçues au rabais, fabriquées au rabais..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1b/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You wouldn't understand! You have no delicate sense of the physical world. This is why you 'hate the gym'! Because you are too desensitized to truly appreciate subtle physical experiences."
msgstr "Tu ne comprendrais pas ! Tu n'as aucun sens délicat du monde physique. C'est pour cela que tu « détestes la salle de sport » ! Parce que ta sensibilité est trop émoussée pour apprécier vraiment les expériences physiques subtiles."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1b/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It is just exercise. What is the big deal?"
msgstr "Ce n'est que de l'exercice. Où est le problème ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1b/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You CANNOT legitimately tell me that 'cardio' is a subtle physical experience."
msgstr "Tu ne peux PAS me dire sérieusement que le « cardio » est une expérience physique subtile."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1c/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "What is the big deal. The BODY is the big deal, you clod! If your BODY, your temple, your cherished home on this little bauble of a blue planet is not worth ultimate focus, then what is?"
msgstr "Où est le problème. Le CORPS est le problème, espèce de {{balourd|balourde|balourd·e}} ! Si ton CORPS, ton temple, ton foyer chéri sur cette petite babiole de planète bleue ne mérite pas une attention suprême, alors quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1c/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Of course, naturally, if you don't like going to the gym you couldn't possibly enjoy spending any more time than necessary around an appliance as... athletic, as myself."
msgstr "Bien sûr, naturellement, si tu n'aimes pas aller à la salle de sport, tu ne saurais prendre plaisir à passer plus de temps que nécessaire près d'un appareil aussi... athlétique que moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1c/0/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And laundry?? Ugh, my, my. I can almost see you rushing away even now."
msgstr "Et le linge ?? Pfff, mon dieu. Je te vois presque déjà t'enfuir à toutes jambes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1c/0/24
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "How boring we must seem to you."
msgstr "Comme nous devons te sembler ennuyeux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1c/0/32
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Believe me, I truly do understand your position."
msgstr "Crois-moi, je comprends vraiment ta position."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1c/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh for the love of... ! Look. Working out just isn't my thing."
msgstr "Oh, par amour du... ! Écoute. Le sport, ce n'est tout simplement pas mon truc."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1c/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are far too handsome to be this sad."
msgstr "Tu es beaucoup trop beau pour être aussi triste."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1c/0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If it means this much to you... maybe you can tell me what you like so much about exercise."
msgstr "Si ça compte autant pour toi... tu peux peut-être me dire ce que tu aimes tant dans l'exercice."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1c/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I am handsome enough to have intense experiences across the emotional spectrum. Actually."
msgstr "Je suis assez beau pour vivre des expériences intenses sur tout le spectre émotionnel. En fait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1c/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But thank you for noticing - you just got points there, you know."
msgstr "Mais merci de l'avoir remarqué, tu viens de marquer des points, tu sais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1c/0/c-1/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I love points! I love challenges."
msgstr "J'adore les points ! J'adore les défis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1c/0/c-1/29/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Intense experiences. Sounds fun."
msgstr "Des expériences intenses. Ça a l'air amusant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1e/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I forgive you, of course. Not everyone is the same. I suppose that's why it's important to find those who like what you like."
msgstr "Je te pardonne, bien sûr. Nous ne sommes pas tous pareils. Je suppose que c'est pour ça qu'il est important de trouver ceux qui aiment ce que l'on aime."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1e/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For sure. Community is pretty important."
msgstr "Tout à fait. La communauté, c'est assez important."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1e/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You must have friends you can do stuff with, though, right?"
msgstr "Tu as sûrement des amis avec qui faire des trucs, non ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1e/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Community is vital indeed. At least mine was. It was not populous, though. It was comprised merely of one other."
msgstr "La communauté est vitale, en effet. La mienne, du moins. Elle n'était pas populeuse, pourtant. Elle ne comptait qu'un seul autre membre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1e/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But what a one."
msgstr "Mais quel membre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1e/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh... I did. I used to."
msgstr "Oh... j'en avais. Autrefois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1e/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I think if you ever have one like him... you wouldn't think of it as just 'working out' anymore. You would understand that it's a kind of worship."
msgstr "Je crois que si tu en as un jour un comme lui... tu ne penserais plus à ça comme à un simple « entraînement ». Tu comprendrais que c'est une forme de culte."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1e/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "One does get lonely without that connection to the divine."
msgstr "On se sent seul, sans ce lien avec le divin."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1e/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did he move away or something?"
msgstr "Il est parti ou quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1e/0/g-0/17/s/0 drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You mean Washford, huh?"
msgstr "Tu parles de Washford, hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1e/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ha. Yes. In a manner of speaking. He moved away from my effervescent embrace into a depressive, teenaged temper tantrum."
msgstr "Ha. Oui. En quelque sorte. Il s'est éloigné de mon étreinte effervescente pour sombrer dans une crise de nerfs dépressive d'adolescent."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1e/0/g-0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds intense. Can I help?"
msgstr "Ça a l'air intense. Je peux aider ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1e/0/g-0/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh man... if I get involved in this, will I have to sweat?"
msgstr "Oh là là... si je me mêle de ça, est-ce que je vais devoir transpirer ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1e/0/g-0/c-3/7 drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes... you've met the Sultan of Sop?"
msgstr "Oui... tu as rencontré le Sultan du Trempé ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1e/0/g-0/c-3/15 drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "We've separated officially. But I do miss the big lug, even if he outdoes my talking 10:1."
msgstr "Nous nous sommes officiellement séparés. Mais ce gros balourd me manque, même s'il parle dix fois plus que moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I am not petty."
msgstr "Je ne suis pas mesquin."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I am endearingly petulant."
msgstr "Je suis d'une susceptibilité attendrissante."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whatever you want to call it."
msgstr "Appelle ça comme tu veux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm just saying."
msgstr "Je dis ça, je dis rien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I want to call it what I called it."
msgstr "Je veux l'appeler comme je l'ai appelé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "It's exhausting having to defend myself. You're making me miss him."
msgstr "C'est épuisant de devoir me défendre. Tu me fais regretter son absence."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes. You are saying. Oh no, not again... you're making me miss him."
msgstr "Oui. Tu dis ça. Oh non, pas encore... tu me fais penser à lui, il me manque."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who?"
msgstr "Qui ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f1/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "My... friend. He would have never called me petty."
msgstr "Mon... ami. Il ne m'aurait jamais traité de mesquin."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f1/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like you guys were a good fit."
msgstr "On dirait que vous alliez bien ensemble."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f1/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe he just used a bigger word."
msgstr "Peut-être qu'il a juste employé un mot plus savant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f2/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I am not sure I like you very much."
msgstr "Je ne suis pas certain de beaucoup t'apprécier."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f2/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're entitled."
msgstr "Tu en as le droit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f2/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think I like you very much, either."
msgstr "Je ne crois pas beaucoup t'apprécier non plus."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f2/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think I like me very much, either."
msgstr "Je ne crois pas beaucoup m'apprécier non plus."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f2/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Hah!"
msgstr "Hah !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But I feel I must thank you. I didn't realize how silly I was being. I didn't realize how nice it was to have someone around me who admired my interests. Someone who tolerated my sweet little idiosyncracities."
msgstr "Mais je dois te remercier. Je ne m'étais pas rendu compte de ma sottise. Je ne m'étais pas rendu compte combien c'était agréable d'avoir près de moi quelqu'un qui admirait mes centres d'intérêt. Quelqu'un qui tolérait mes douces petites idiosyncrasies."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f2/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...sweet?"
msgstr "...douces ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f2/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's me."
msgstr "C'est tout moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f2/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes, they're sweet. Shush."
msgstr "Oui, elles sont douces. Chut."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f2/0/g-1/0/b/1
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But now I do. I've made a momentous decision, person-I-may-like... I wonder. Would you consider doing me a favor?"
msgstr "Mais maintenant, si. J'ai pris une décision capitale, personne-que-j'aime-peut-être... Je me demande. Accepterais-tu de me rendre un service ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f2/0/g-1/3/b/1
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But now I do. I've made a momentous decision, person-I-don't-very-much-like... I wonder. Would you consider doing me a favor?"
msgstr "Mais maintenant, si. J'ai pris une décision capitale, personne-que-je-n'aime-pas-trop... Je me demande. Accepterais-tu de me rendre un service ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f2/0/g-1/6/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Geez, I sure do love my new nickname!"
msgstr "Mince alors, j'adore mon nouveau surnom !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first1f2/0/g-1/7/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only if it doesn't involve deltoids."
msgstr "Seulement si ça n'implique pas de deltoïdes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "There will be almost no muscular exertion at all... Ok, there is a little bit but you won't break a sweat, I promise!"
msgstr "Il n'y aura presque aucun effort musculaire... Bon, un tout petit peu, mais tu ne transpireras pas, promis !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/8/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Call Washford for me."
msgstr "Appelle Washford pour moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/8/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What, like on the phone?"
msgstr "Quoi, comme au téléphone ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/8/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait, are you kidding me?! You are physically on top of each other, and you're not talking?"
msgstr "Attends, tu te moques de moi ?! Vous êtes littéralement l'un sur l'autre, et vous ne vous parlez pas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "No, just with your voice. Just vibrate those glorious pipes of yours and call out the name, Washford!"
msgstr "Non, juste avec ta voix. Fais vibrer ces glorieux tuyaux qui te servent de voix et lance le nom : Washford !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes! OB-viously! If he were genuinely far away this would be so much less torturous, but as it is... It's the stuff of pure DRAMA. Sumptuous, don't you think?"
msgstr "Oui ! ÉVI-demment ! S'il était vraiment loin, ce serait bien moins torturant, mais en l'état... C'est du pur DRAME. Somptueux, tu ne trouves pas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh, he's a human now."
msgstr "Euh, c'est un humain, maintenant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You two are RIDICULOUS."
msgstr "Vous êtes RIDICULES, tous les deux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/g-0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't believe I'm doing this. <i>'Washford!!'</i>"
msgstr "Je n'arrive pas à croire que je fais ça. <i>« Washford !! »</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/g-0/3/s/0 drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/g-0/c-3/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>'Washford!!'</i>"
msgstr "<i>« Washford !! »</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/g-0/4/s/0 drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_return_solo/0/17/s/0 drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_return_solo/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Drysdale... could you call Washford?"
msgstr "Drysdale... tu pourrais appeler Washford ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh yes... yes, gloriously! You'll do it? Please!"
msgstr "Oh oui... oui, glorieusement ! Tu vas le faire ? S'il te plaît !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/g-0/c-3/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Absolutely not."
msgstr "Absolument pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/g-0/c-6/7 drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_return_solo/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well... well yes I could, I suppose. I have the capability. But what would it accomplish?"
msgstr "Eh bien... eh bien oui, je pourrais, je suppose. J'en ai la capacité. Mais à quoi bon ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/g-0/c-6/18 drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_return_solo/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "What possible good could that do except perhaps to exercise my voice which needs not one more rep of exercise because it is already in exceptionally perfect condition."
msgstr "Quel bien cela pourrait-il faire, sinon d'exercer ma voix, qui n'a pas besoin d'une seule répétition de plus puisqu'elle est déjà dans une forme exceptionnellement parfaite."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me/0/g-0/c-6/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Tee hee</i> - maybe it'll be worth it..."
msgstr "<i>Hi hi</i> - ça en vaudra peut-être la peine..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me2/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ohhh my, a juice bar! What a person will do to a poor unsuspecting vegetable. The modern era's answer to vampirism!"
msgstr "Ohhh mon dieu, un bar à jus ! Ce qu'on peut faire subir à un pauvre légume sans méfiance ! La réponse de l'ère moderne au vampirisme !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me2/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You went to kind of a dark place with that."
msgstr "Tu as pris un tournant plutôt sombre, là."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me2/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I love the way you talk."
msgstr "J'adore ta façon de parler."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me2/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "That's the way! Yes, yes!"
msgstr "Voilà ! Oui, oui !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me1/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Indeed my darling, biting wit just comes so naturally to me, you must understand... I can't avoid it, it's like a collar-popper popping his collar—it's a REFLEX!"
msgstr "En effet, mon chou, l'esprit mordant me vient si naturellement, tu dois comprendre... je ne peux pas l'éviter, c'est comme un frimeur qui relève son col, c'est un RÉFLEXE !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me1/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I won't make you do something you don't want to do! I will only ask you to help me repair the rift with the one who DOES want to be with me. Will you help me?"
msgstr "Je ne te ferai pas faire ce que tu ne veux pas ! Je te demande seulement de m'aider à réparer la brèche avec celui qui, LUI, veut être avec moi. Tu m'aides ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me1/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're really going to do this?"
msgstr "Tu vas vraiment faire ça ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes! I understand it now, I... I love him, we must reconcile! But I need your help."
msgstr "Oui ! Je le comprends maintenant, je... je l'aime, nous devons nous réconcilier ! Mais j'ai besoin de ton aide."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me1/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...ok. Yes. What do I have to do? Do I need to pack a lunch?"
msgstr "...d'accord. Oui. Qu'est-ce que je dois faire ? Je dois emporter un casse-croûte ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_fail/0/4
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Just wait a moment... he should be here."
msgstr "Attends un instant... il devrait arriver."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_fail/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think he's coming."
msgstr "Je ne crois pas qu'il vienne."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_fail/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "It appears your pipes are not glorious enough to traverse the great distance that still persists between us."
msgstr "Il semble que tes tuyaux ne soient pas assez glorieux pour franchir la grande distance qui persiste entre nous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_fail/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You'll have to use your feet."
msgstr "Tu devras utiliser tes pieds."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_fail/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Not as glorious... slightly floppy, really, but hopefully effective."
msgstr "Moins glorieux... un peu mous, en vérité, mais efficaces, espérons-le."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_fail/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Have at it!"
msgstr "À toi de jouer !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/absolutely_not_call/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "A pooper of parties. Begone, worm."
msgstr "Un rabat-joie. Hors de ma vue, vermisseau."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/absolutely_not_call/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He shoos you away with a flippant little wave of his hand."
msgstr "Il vous chasse d'un petit geste désinvolte de la main."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Indeed! I am an enthusiast for anything that challenges all sides of my glorious vessel."
msgstr "En effet ! Je suis friand de tout ce qui met à l'épreuve chaque facette de mon glorieux vaisseau."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How do you work out exactly?"
msgstr "Comment tu t'entraînes, exactement ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Cherub, I cannot even begin to tell you. But I am nothing if not inventive, fearless, indefatigable!"
msgstr "Mon ange, je ne saurais même pas par où commencer. Mais je suis inventif, intrépide, infatigable, ou je ne suis rien !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And like I said... modest."
msgstr "Et comme je disais... modeste."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You must be creative, too."
msgstr "Tu dois être créatif, aussi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well. I'm sure you'll forgive me, won't you, darling."
msgstr "Eh bien. Je suis sûr que tu me pardonneras, n'est-ce pas, mon chou."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Devilishly so."
msgstr "Diablement, oui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I haven't given up the hope that I'll yet be able to craft a perfect metabolic masterpiece!"
msgstr "Je n'ai pas renoncé à l'espoir de concevoir un jour un chef-d'oeuvre métabolique parfait !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Using only what's here in the laundry room?"
msgstr "En utilisant seulement ce qu'il y a ici, dans la buanderie ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2a/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Gasp."
msgstr "Haaah !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2a/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I've had a sudden flash that I should feel excited but I am not sure why, explain yourself, brain."
msgstr "J'ai eu une illumination soudaine : je devrais être excité, mais je ne sais pas pourquoi, explique-toi, cerveau."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2a/0/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh! No! Wait I've figured it out, Oh that's more points for me, huzzah!"
msgstr "Oh ! Non ! Attends, j'ai compris, oh, voilà encore des points pour moi, hourra !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2a/0/24
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Would you, my new lovely acquaintance, like to help me create the perfect challenge for my body and mind?"
msgstr "Voudrais-tu, ma nouvelle et charmante connaissance, m'aider à créer le défi parfait pour mon corps et mon esprit ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2a/0/32
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Would you help me invent a tango for the triceps, a conga for the core, a quickstep for the quadriceps?!"
msgstr "M'aiderais-tu à inventer un tango pour les triceps, une conga pour la ceinture abdominale, un quickstep pour les quadriceps ?!"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2a/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Build a workout together? That sounds awesome!"
msgstr "Concevoir un entraînement ensemble ? Ça a l'air génial !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2a/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think so. I'm really not a very fit person."
msgstr "Je ne crois pas. Ma condition physique laisse vraiment à désirer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2a/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "That's the point, my little marshmallow."
msgstr "C'est justement ça, mon petit chamallow."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2a/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "We start with the obliques!"
msgstr "On commence par les obliques !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2a/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Very important to twist, turn... and watch your booty in the mirror."
msgstr "Très important de se tordre, de pivoter... et de surveiller son popotin dans le miroir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2a/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He gives his posterior a little wiggle for emphasis."
msgstr "Il remue légèrement son postérieur pour appuyer son propos."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Awesome. Yes. As in capable of inspiring awe. <i>Just</i> like my obliques. Yes? Yes..."
msgstr "Génial. Oui. Au sens de « digne d'un génie ». <i>Tout</i> comme mes obliques. Oui ? Oui..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Love the humility, dude."
msgstr "J'adore l'humilité, mec."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Obliques! We'll start there."
msgstr "Les obliques ! On commence par là."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b1a/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh my cherub, why be humble when you can be HAWT?"
msgstr "Oh mon ange, pourquoi être modeste quand on peut être CAAANON ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b1a/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really? With a 'w'?"
msgstr "Vraiment ? Avec plein de « a » ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b1a/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh lighten up, 'W's need love, too! Away we go!"
msgstr "Oh, détends-toi, les « A » aussi ont besoin d'amour ! C'est parti !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b1a/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What should we start with first?"
msgstr "On commence par quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b1a/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Obliques!"
msgstr "Les obliques !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b1/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I know! I can lie down with Florence, grasp Tydus by her intimidating epaulettes and Russian twist her for three sets of twenty!"
msgstr "Je sais ! Je peux m'allonger sur Florence, saisir Tydus par ses épaulettes intimidantes et lui faire des rotations russes, trois séries de vingt !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b1/0/8/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "What do you think?"
msgstr "Qu'en penses-tu ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b1/0/8/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who is Florence?"
msgstr "C'est qui, Florence ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b1/0/8/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tydus? What's that?"
msgstr "Tydus ? C'est quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b1/0/8/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really don't think Tydus is going to like being twisted!"
msgstr "Je ne crois vraiment pas que Tydus apprécie de se faire tordre !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b1/0/8/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about a hanging knee raise instead?"
msgstr "Et si on faisait plutôt des relevés de genoux suspendus ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b2/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Florence. The floor! You haven't met Florence?"
msgstr "Florence. Le sol ! Tu n'as pas encore rencontré Florence ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b2/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not yet!"
msgstr "Pas encore !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "She and Mayor Celia are my two favorite Dishy Divas!"
msgstr "Elle et la Maire Celia sont mes deux Divas Canon préférées !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b2/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "We get together, a little lambrusco, raise a little hell."
msgstr "On se retrouve, un peu de lambrusco, on fait un peu les quatre cents coups."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b2/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "She hates working out but I'm absolutely sure she'll support me."
msgstr "Elle déteste faire du sport, mais je suis absolument sûr qu'elle me soutiendra."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b2/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh, I made another joke! That one wasn't even intentional! I'm amazing."
msgstr "Oh, j'ai fait une autre blague ! Celle-là n'était même pas volontaire ! Je suis formidable."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_tydus/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Tydus! The detergent. If you think I'm dramatic..."
msgstr "Tydus ! La lessive. Si tu me trouves dramatique..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b3/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh cherub, you're right. I didn't even think of that. So you've met her, then?"
msgstr "Oh mon ange, tu as raison. Je n'y avais même pas pensé. Tu l'as donc déjà rencontrée ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b3/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, but I've heard about her."
msgstr "Non, mais j'ai entendu parler d'elle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b3/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yes, I have! She's wild! She yelled at me in pentameter!"
msgstr "Et comment ! Elle est déchaînée ! Elle m'a hurlé dessus en alexandrins !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b3a/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "She might not appreciate being included in my sweat sesh, but twisted... let's just say she has some dark and deeply held feelings."
msgstr "Elle n'apprécierait peut-être pas d'être incluse dans ma séance de sudation, mais tordue... disons qu'elle a des sentiments sombres et profondément enracinés."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b3a/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh I know it..."
msgstr "Oh, je sais..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b3a/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think maybe I'm afraid of her now. A little."
msgstr "Je crois que j'ai peur d'elle, maintenant. Un peu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b3a/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is the weirdest laundry room..."
msgstr "C'est la buanderie la plus bizarre..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b3a/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok, let's work those glutes!"
msgstr "Bon, allons travailler ces fessiers !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b3a/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh those ellipses tell me everything!"
msgstr "Oh, ces points de suspension en disent long !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b3a/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Tell me, my little meringue... Did you whip her into a frenzy?"
msgstr "Dis-moi, ma petite meringue... l'as-tu fouettée jusqu'à la frénésie ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b3a/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That'll be a story for another time."
msgstr "Ce sera une histoire pour une autre fois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b3a/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Frenzy. Pure, meringue-y frenzy."
msgstr "Frénésie. Pure frénésie meringuée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b4/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh dear. No, I don't think that's a good idea."
msgstr "Oh là là. Non, je ne crois pas que ce soit une bonne idée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b4/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh oh. Why?"
msgstr "Aïe. Pourquoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b4/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Darling. What would I hang from?"
msgstr "Mon chou. À quoi me suspendrais-je ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b4/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The door frame?"
msgstr "Au chambranle ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b4/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The wall?"
msgstr "Au mur ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b4/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Dorian!"
msgstr "Dorian !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b4/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Wallace!"
msgstr "Wallace !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b4b/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Have you seen him? A slice a la mode. How could I ever focus on form with, with that... that FORM before me?? Oh no. No more temptations. I must keep my movement pure."
msgstr "L'as-tu vu ? Un vrai dessert. Comment me concentrer sur ma posture avec, avec cette... cette FORME sous les yeux ?? Oh non. Plus de tentations. Je dois garder mon mouvement pur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b4b/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Right. Good thinking. How about burpees?"
msgstr "D'accord. Bien vu. Et des burpees ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b4b/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Try shutting up for five minutes."
msgstr "Essaie de la fermer pendant cinq minutes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b4b/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You could run five miles and then dance all night?"
msgstr "Tu pourrais courir huit kilomètres puis danser toute la nuit ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b4b/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's get you flying again... with 1000 jumping jacks!"
msgstr "Remettons-toi en vol... avec 1000 jumping jacks !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b5/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ah, you are a cruel task master. Lucky for you I am exceptionally well-mastered!"
msgstr "Ah, tu es un contremaître cruel. Heureusement pour toi, je suis exceptionnellement bien dressé !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b5/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Rigorous training is the only way forward, the only way to progress. Bring me the ecstasy of discipline, the sublime breath of skill!"
msgstr "L'entraînement rigoureux est la seule voie, la seule façon de progresser. Apporte-moi l'extase de la discipline, le souffle sublime du talent !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b5/0/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh for the love of lint. I sound like him."
msgstr "Oh, par amour de la peluche. Je parle comme lui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b5/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like who?"
msgstr "Comme qui ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b5/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Washford, of course. He is almost monastic in his approach to physical work. I've never been in better shape."
msgstr "Washford, bien sûr. Il aborde le travail physique presque en moine. Je n'ai jamais été en meilleure forme."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "May I divulge an eensy, weensy little secret?"
msgstr "Puis-je divulguer un tout petit, minuscule secret ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...sure?"
msgstr "...bien sûr ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The weensier the better."
msgstr "Plus c'est minuscule, mieux c'est."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "To me, it isn't The Gluteus Maximus..."
msgstr "Pour moi, ce n'est pas le Grand Fessier..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "It's the Glorious Marvelous! It's my favorite muscle group. I even love sitting on it, I'm that much of a fan!"
msgstr "C'est le Grandiose Fessier ! C'est mon groupe musculaire préféré. J'adore même m'asseoir dessus, tant j'en suis fan !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6/0/g-0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Then let's get it rockin'!"
msgstr "Alors faisons-le bouger !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6/0/g-0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Same here. Weirdly."
msgstr "Pareil pour moi. Bizarrement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6/0/g-0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you have a favorite exercise for it?"
msgstr "Tu as un exercice préféré pour ça ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/4
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Le perfect move, Le Deadlift. Deadlift deadlift deadlift. Ahahahah! Ambrosia!"
msgstr "Le mouvement parfait, Le Soulevé de Terre. Soulevé de terre, soulevé de terre, soulevé de terre. Ahahahah ! Ambroisie !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's the best thing to deadlift around here?"
msgstr "Quelle est la meilleure chose à soulever ici ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Look around, what do you think?"
msgstr "Regarde autour de toi, qu'en penses-tu ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The hamper?"
msgstr "Le panier à linge ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The washing machine?"
msgstr "Le lave-linge ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Gasp! Harper? No no no, Innocent."
msgstr "Haaa ! Harper ? Non non non, petite âme."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/g-0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "She is a lovely girl but I don't want her getting any ideas about... attachment. Interest. Life long devotion and betrayal, that sort of thing. She's... touchy."
msgstr "C'est une adorable fille, mais je ne voudrais pas qu'elle se fasse des idées sur... l'attachement. L'intérêt. La dévotion éternelle et la trahison, ce genre de choses. Elle est... susceptible."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/g-0/c-1/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds fun."
msgstr "Ça a l'air amusant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/g-0/c-1/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds terrifying."
msgstr "Ça a l'air terrifiant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/g-0/c-1/26/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like we can't do deadlifts, then."
msgstr "On dirait qu'on ne peut pas faire de soulevé de terre, alors."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/g-0/c-1/26/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eh, I was able to get her to love me."
msgstr "Bah, j'ai réussi à me faire aimer d'elle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/g-0/c-1/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes! Fun! As long as your idea of fun involves stalking, bodyspray-scented death threats and those twisty eyes one might find on a psychotic clown."
msgstr "Oui ! Amusant ! Si ta définition de l'amusement inclut le harcèlement, les menaces de mort parfumées au déodorant et ces yeux tournoyants qu'on trouve chez un clown psychopathe."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/g-0/c-1/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "She's a sweetheart. Really. But... no."
msgstr "C'est un amour. Vraiment. Mais... non."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/g-0/c-1/26/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Terrifying. Yes. Like a possessed pomeranian."
msgstr "Terrifiant. Oui. Comme un loulou de Poméranie possédé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/g-0/c-1/26/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Cherub. Can you think of nothing else here that might present a challenge to our redoubtable rear-ends?"
msgstr "Mon ange. Ne vois-tu rien d'autre ici qui pourrait mettre au défi nos redoutables popotins ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/g-0/c-1/26/c-3/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Really? You're learned the trick to her wicker. Impressive."
msgstr "Vraiment ? Tu as appris le truc pour son osier. Impressionnant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/g-0/c-1/26/c-3/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But really, cherub..."
msgstr "Mais vraiment, mon ange..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/g-0/c-1/26/c-3/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Can you think of nothing else here that might present a challenge to our redoubtable rear-ends?"
msgstr "Ne vois-tu rien d'autre ici qui pourrait mettre au défi nos redoutables popotins ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6b/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "The washing machine."
msgstr "Le lave-linge."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6c/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Umm.... The washing machine?"
msgstr "Euh.... Le lave-linge ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6c/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh... Ohh I see."
msgstr "Oh... Ohh je vois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6c/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes. The washing machine. My Washford. I used to use Washford."
msgstr "Oui. Le lave-linge. Mon Washford. Autrefois, je me servais de Washford."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6c/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You used to deadlift Washford?"
msgstr "Tu soulevais Washford ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6c/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Then screw it! Let's honor those glutes!"
msgstr "Alors tant pis ! Honorons ces fessiers !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6c/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes. I would lift him - he would lift me..."
msgstr "Oui. Je le soulevais, lui me soulevait..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6c/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "My Glorious Marvelous. It has fallen into such disrepair in recent years."
msgstr "Mon Grandiose Fessier. Il est tombé dans un tel état de délabrement ces dernières années."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6c/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Honor thy glutes?"
msgstr "Honorer tes fessiers ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6c/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok, well let's move onto our pecs, and not worry about The Glorious Marvelous for now."
msgstr "Bon, passons aux pectoraux, et ne nous soucions pas du Grandiose Fessier pour l'instant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6c/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's go get him, and fix all this old miscommunication and get a real workout in!!"
msgstr "Allons le chercher, réglons tout ce vieux malentendu et faisons une vraie séance !!"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6c/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You're right! Onward and upward! I emerge from the darkness and like the phoenix rising from the ashes I call my love back to me! My truest love and friend!"
msgstr "Tu as raison ! En avant et vers le haut ! Je sors des ténèbres et, tel le phénix renaissant de ses cendres, je rappelle mon amour à moi ! Mon amour le plus vrai et mon ami !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6c/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Dear you, you don't happen to have a feather boa on you, by any chance? I always dreamed if I did something this dramatic I'd be draped in a bright purple feather boa!"
msgstr "Dis-moi, mon ange, tu n'aurais pas sur toi un boa en plumes, par hasard ? J'ai toujours rêvé que si je faisais quelque chose d'aussi dramatique, je serais drapé dans un boa de plumes violet vif !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6c/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I might... ?"
msgstr "J'en ai peut-être un... ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6c/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't."
msgstr "Je n'en ai pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6c/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Don't worry about answering that. I know your garments intimately."
msgstr "Inutile de répondre. Je connais tes vêtements dans leurs moindres replis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b6c/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And there ain't no boa."
msgstr "Et il n'y a pas de boa."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b7/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "If we're going to do a chest workout it can only be a fly... if it's a press..."
msgstr "Si on fait une séance de pectoraux, ce ne peut être que des écartés... si c'est un développé..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b7/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "To your surprise, Drysdale's eyes glimmer with tears."
msgstr "À votre surprise, les yeux de Drysdale brillent de larmes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b7/0/27/s/0 drysdale_dryer/friend_1d/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qui ne va pas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b7/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Washford and I used to use each other for the press, too! I feel so silly..."
msgstr "Washford et moi nous servions aussi l'un de l'autre pour le développé ! Je me sens ridicule..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b7/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I hadn't realized that a simple workout session would bring up so much history, so much emotion..."
msgstr "Je n'avais pas réalisé qu'une simple séance d'entraînement ferait remonter tant d'histoire, tant d'émotion..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b7/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "This is why I don't work out more."
msgstr "Voilà pourquoi je ne m'entraîne pas davantage."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b7/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "It's not that I'm lazy. I'm just..."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas que je sois paresseux. C'est juste que..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b7/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Crying like this is just... so damn draining."
msgstr "Pleurer comme ça est tellement... épuisant, bon sang."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b8/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "AHAhhahha, yes darling, yes. Lean into that feeling. God, a little healthy fear is better than a brand new lint filter!"
msgstr "AHAhhahha, oui, mon chou, oui. Penche-toi vers ce sentiment. Seigneur, un peu de peur saine vaut mieux qu'un filtre à peluches flambant neuf !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_first2b8/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But you shall conquer it. I must say, watching you be bold is bringing up the most daring idea for me. I'm wondering if you would do me a favor..."
msgstr "Mais tu la vaincras. Je dois dire que te voir être audacieux me fait naître l'idée la plus osée. Je me demande si tu me rendrais un service..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_second_encounter/0/6/b/1
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh, you're back? Try not to bore me too much this time!"
msgstr "Oh, te revoilà ? Tâche de ne pas trop m'ennuyer cette fois !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_second_encounter/0/9/b/1
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Cherub - you've returned! Oh I wonder what wild things you'll say this time."
msgstr "Mon ange, te revoilà ! Oh, je me demande quelles folies tu vas dire cette fois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_second_encounter/0/12
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I challenge you to leave me speechless."
msgstr "Je te mets au défi de me laisser sans voix."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_second_encounter/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's a tarantula on your butt!"
msgstr "Il y a une tarentule sur tes fesses !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_second_encounter/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I ride inside you for a bit?"
msgstr "Je peux faire un tour à l'intérieur de toi un moment ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_second_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "My MY what a lucky spider. Ever seen a tarantula on a trampoline? Because that's how tight these glutes are."
msgstr "Ça alors, quelle araignée chanceuse. Déjà vu une tarentule sur un trampoline ? C'est exactement à ce point que ces fessiers sont fermes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1aa/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well well, look at you! That may be possible! I do adore trying new things."
msgstr "Eh bien eh bien, regarde-toi ! C'est peut-être possible ! J'adore essayer de nouvelles choses."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1aa/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like me? I'm new, right?"
msgstr "Comme moi ? Je suis une nouveauté, non ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1aa/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ooh so you are! More points for you! You are doing well. What a fun game this is."
msgstr "Ooh, mais oui ! Des points en plus pour toi ! Tu t'en sors bien. Quel jeu amusant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1aa/0/c-0/27/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't even know we were playing!"
msgstr "Je ne savais même pas qu'on jouait !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1aa/0/c-0/27/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, let's get you some points too!"
msgstr "Eh bien, allons te faire gagner des points à toi aussi !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh, goodness, I do love to play. What's life without a little harmless diversion?"
msgstr "Oh, mon dieu, j'adore jouer. Que serait la vie sans un petit divertissement inoffensif ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't know that I'd call me harmless..."
msgstr "Pas sûr d'être sans danger, moi..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It would be pretty boring. What kinds of things do you do for fun?"
msgstr "Ce serait plutôt ennuyeux. Qu'est-ce que tu fais pour t'amuser ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh, really. You think you can bring a little danger into my world, do you?"
msgstr "Oh, vraiment. Tu crois pouvoir apporter un peu de danger dans mon monde, n'est-ce pas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You are positively delectable when you're showing off, you know."
msgstr "Tu es absolument délectable quand tu fais le fanfaron, tu sais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are scoring a lot of points with me right now!"
msgstr "Tu marques énormément de points avec moi, là !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You should see me lift weights. I'm basically Hercules."
msgstr "Tu devrais me voir soulever des poids. Je suis pratiquement Hercule."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ah weightlifting. How I miss it!"
msgstr "Ah, la musculation. Comme elle me manque !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-0/23/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You used to lift?"
msgstr "Tu soulevais, avant ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-0/23/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, you told me..."
msgstr "Oui, tu me l'as dit..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-0/7/b/1
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I did. In fact, I told you I did... For shame."
msgstr "C'est vrai. D'ailleurs, je te l'ai dit... Quelle honte."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-0/7/b/9
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You silly donut, look at me! Of course I used to lift. Ah, how I loved it!"
msgstr "Mon petit beignet, regarde-moi ! Bien sûr que je soulevais. Ah, comme j'aimais ça !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-0/10
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes. Doesn't it show? I loved it."
msgstr "Oui. Ça ne se voit pas ? J'adorais ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You remembered!"
msgstr "Tu t'en souviens !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-0/23/c-1/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Points! Points all around!"
msgstr "Des points ! Des points partout !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh, I'm fairly easy to amuse. Cards, conversation, a nice chardonnay or three."
msgstr "Oh, je suis assez facile à amuser. Les cartes, la conversation, un bon chardonnay ou trois."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm pretty jealous you can keep that figure with those as your hobbies!"
msgstr "Je t'envie à mort de garder cette silhouette avec ces passe-temps !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well, those aren't my only pastimes."
msgstr "Eh bien, ce ne sont pas mes seuls passe-temps."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I do have... other, more physical, pursuits."
msgstr "J'ai d'autres occupations... plus physiques."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like weightlifting?"
msgstr "Comme la musculation ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like sex?"
msgstr "Comme le sexe ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/13
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes! Like SEX."
msgstr "Oui ! Comme le SEXE."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/21
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Do you... like... sex?"
msgstr "Aimes-tu... disons... le sexe ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, love it. All for it."
msgstr "Oui, j'adore. À fond pour."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And you like it when two charming male-orientated appliances have feelings for each other and act on those feelings?"
msgstr "Et cela te plaît-il quand deux charmants appareils attirés par les hommes ont des sentiments l'un pour l'autre et agissent en conséquence ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/29/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh no, not that."
msgstr "Oh non, pas ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/29/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course - why would that be a problem?"
msgstr "Bien sûr, pourquoi est-ce que ce serait un problème ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/29/c-0/15/c-0/7 drysdale_dryer/friend_1c/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Hm."
msgstr "Hm."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/29/c-0/15/c-0/15 drysdale_dryer/friend_1c/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well."
msgstr "Eh bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/29/c-0/15/c-0/23 drysdale_dryer/friend_1c/0/g-0/c-4/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I have found myself very much unfascinated by you."
msgstr "Je me découvre fort peu fasciné par toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/29/c-0/15/c-0/31 drysdale_dryer/friend_1c/0/g-0/c-4/31
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "Au revoir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/29/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I am ever so pleased by this answer!"
msgstr "Cette réponse me ravit au plus haut point !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1a/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/29/c-0/15/c-1/15 drysdale_dryer/friend_1c/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/7 drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Points!"
msgstr "Des points !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1c/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Not exactly... Well sometimes I would be the <i>weight</i> rather than the lifter."
msgstr "Pas exactement... Disons que parfois, j'étais la <i>charge</i> plutôt que celui qui soulève."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1c/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ah. That's, uh, interesting..."
msgstr "Ah. C'est, euh, intéressant..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1c/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Makes sense to me."
msgstr "Ça me paraît logique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1c/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I knew it. You have an aversion to boys being on top of boys."
msgstr "Je le savais. Tu as une aversion pour les garçons au-dessus des garçons."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1c/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh wow, no, nothing like that... I wasn't... it's not that."
msgstr "Oh là, non, rien de tel... je n'étais pas... ce n'est pas ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1c/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not at all! Gold star for bringing sex back into the conversation, though."
msgstr "Pas du tout ! Bon point pour avoir ramené le sexe dans la conversation, cela dit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1c/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The only thing I have an aversion to is this boring-ass conversation."
msgstr "La seule chose qui me répugne, c'est cette conversation ultra-chiante."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1c/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh GOOD. I have no preference on others' preferences, of course..."
msgstr "Oh, PARFAIT. Je n'ai aucune préférence sur les préférences des autres, bien sûr..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1c/0/g-0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Neither do I! Do what you want with who you want, I say."
msgstr "Moi non plus ! Fais ce que tu veux avec qui tu veux, je dis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "My my, look at you! Collecting all the points, and the gold stars and the defending of the personal freedoms! I love it!"
msgstr "Mais regarde-toi ! Tu ramasses tous les points, les bons points et la défense des libertés individuelles ! J'adore !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You know what else I love? Flowers. Big bouquets of them. Birds of Paradise are my favorites. They're impossible to get here."
msgstr "Tu sais ce que j'adore d'autre ? Les fleurs. De gros bouquets. Les oiseaux de paradis sont mes préférés. Impossible d'en avoir ici."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "By here... you mean in the laundry room?"
msgstr "Par « ici »... tu veux dire dans la buanderie ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd get you flowers - I promise."
msgstr "Je t'offrirai des fleurs, promis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes. It's something about the humidity which I think is ridiculous because Paradise by definition is tropical."
msgstr "Oui. Il paraît que c'est à cause de l'humidité, ce qui est ridicule puisque le Paradis est par définition tropical."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Or maybe it was something about the fact that it's inside, which again, is asinine because I have met so many birds and the majority of them were thrilled with their cages which were, without exception, inside."
msgstr "Ou peut-être était-ce à cause du fait que c'est à l'intérieur, ce qui est de nouveau stupide, car j'ai rencontré tant d'oiseaux et la majorité étaient ravis de leurs cages qui étaient, sans exception, à l'intérieur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was a lot of information."
msgstr "Ça fait beaucoup d'informations."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes! Wasn't it!"
msgstr "Oui ! N'est-ce pas !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/c-1/7/b/1
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh but you did - you did! That Prissy being here gives me so much more wonderful greenery to contemplate."
msgstr "Oh, mais tu l'as fait, tu l'as fait ! Que Prissy soit ici me donne tellement plus de merveilleuse verdure à contempler."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/c-1/10/b/1
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I wish you would try..."
msgstr "J'aimerais que tu essaies..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "It's just been so long since I had anyone to talk to!"
msgstr "Ça fait si longtemps que je n'avais personne à qui parler !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "OH! How are you ever going to take care of me if you don't know my personal tastes?"
msgstr "OH ! Comment vas-tu prendre soin de moi si tu ne connais pas mes goûts personnels ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're right, I'll ask!"
msgstr "Tu as raison, je vais demander !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about my preferences?"
msgstr "Et mes préférences à moi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Cherub I <i>know</i> your preferences from your 'timed dry' settings to your deplorable lack of laundry sheet usage."
msgstr "Mon ange, je <i>connais</i> tes préférences, de tes réglages de « séchage minuté » à ton manque déplorable de lingettes assouplissantes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ask me a question - divine my being."
msgstr "Pose-moi une question, devine mon être."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What is your favorite color?"
msgstr "Quelle est ta couleur préférée ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bleu cheese olives - yea or nay?"
msgstr "Olives au bleu : pour ou contre ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/g-1/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What is 81,245 divided by 6,201?"
msgstr "Combien font 81 245 divisé par 6 201 ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/g-1/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you're full of yourself."
msgstr "Je trouve que tu te prends pour le centre du monde."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "What else should I be full of, cherub, if not myself?"
msgstr "De quoi d'autre devrais-je être plein, mon ange, si ce n'est de moi-même ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b/0/g-1/c-7/21
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well. Certainly not <i>you</i>."
msgstr "Eh bien. Certainement pas de <i>toi</i>."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b1/0/6
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Forever and perfectly a combination of lavender purple and baby blue culminating in a sultry, subtle, undeniable PERIWINKLE next question!"
msgstr "Toujours et parfaitement un mélange de violet lavande et de bleu layette qui culmine en un PERVENCHE sensuel, subtil, indéniable, question suivante !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b1/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sultry periwinkle?"
msgstr "Pervenche sensuel ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Sultry, my darling examiner, I am seduced by beauty!"
msgstr "Sensuel, mon cher interrogateur, je suis séduit par la beauté !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b2/6
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Bleu cheese? Didst thou say bleu cheese?!"
msgstr "Du bleu ? As-tu dit du bleu ?!"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b2/17
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "It's burrata or death!!"
msgstr "C'est burrata ou la mort !!"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b2/25
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Olives without accoutrements, though, I once ate a whole jar unassisted. Washford couldn't stand to kiss me for days. At least not on the mouth. Ha!"
msgstr "Des olives sans accompagnement, en revanche, j'ai un jour avalé un bocal entier tout seul. Washford a refusé de m'embrasser pendant des jours. Du moins pas sur la bouche. Ha !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b2/33
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But it was tasty."
msgstr "Mais c'était délicieux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b2/41
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I've never been sorry."
msgstr "Je n'ai jamais regretté."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b3/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "My interest is a dying bird."
msgstr "Mon intérêt est un oiseau mourant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b3/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, you can do it, just set up the division..."
msgstr "Non, tu peux le faire, pose juste la division..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b3/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, I'll skip the math questions."
msgstr "Pardon, je passe les questions de maths."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b3/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "It flaps and gasps for breath, oh my god pass it the chardonnay!"
msgstr "Il bat des ailes et suffoque, oh mon dieu, passez-lui le chardonnay !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b3/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I've already forgotten every number you've told me - next!"
msgstr "J'ai déjà oublié tous les nombres que tu m'as dits, suivante !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b4/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Right, moving on! What is your favorite breed of dog?"
msgstr "Bon, passons à autre chose ! Quelle est ta race de chien préférée ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b4/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok, on we go then, how do you make a cake rise without yeast?"
msgstr "Bon, on continue alors, comment faire lever un gâteau sans levure ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b4/0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's try one more; what is the chemical formula for table salt?"
msgstr "Une dernière ; quelle est la formule chimique du sel de table ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b5/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh, this is an easy one. I have a long-standing love affair with the tassel hound."
msgstr "Oh, celle-là est facile. J'ai une histoire d'amour de longue date avec le chien à pompons."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b5/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And if you don't know what a tassel hound is, which wouldn't surprise me given that you're, well, human, you MUST go chat with Mateo."
msgstr "Et si tu ne sais pas ce qu'est un chien à pompons, ce qui ne m'étonnerait pas vu que tu es, enfin, de l'espèce humaine, tu DOIS aller discuter avec Mateo."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b5/0/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "He has so damned many of them, you know, and they're ADORABLE."
msgstr "Il en a tellement, nom d'un chien, et ils sont ADORABLES."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b5/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why do you think he has so many?"
msgstr "Pourquoi crois-tu qu'il en a autant ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b5/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've met him - I'm helping him to find his own tassel hound!"
msgstr "Je l'ai rencontré, je l'aide à trouver son propre chien à pompons !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b5/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've met him - and even found his own tassel hound, Davi!"
msgstr "Je l'ai rencontré, et j'ai même trouvé son propre chien à pompons, Davi !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b5/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh truffle, the psychology behind a blanket with a pet collection, I couldn't even begin to hypothesize. On with the game!"
msgstr "Oh, ma truffe, la psychologie derrière une couverture avec une collection d'animaux, je ne saurais même pas par où commencer pour émettre une hypothèse. Reprenons le jeu !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b5/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Hm! Well I would <i>love</i> to help but I can't be bothered as I have this physique to sculpt..."
msgstr "Hm ! Eh bien j'<i>adorerais</i> aider mais je ne peux pas me déranger, j'ai ce physique à sculpter..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b5/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ah! The exploring type!"
msgstr "Ah ! Le genre explorateur !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b5/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Not always my preference - I tend to go for the ones who stick themselves in one place, stubbornly... forever..."
msgstr "Pas toujours ma préférence, j'ai plutôt tendance à choisir ceux qui se plantent à un seul endroit, obstinément... pour toujours..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Easy! Put it on top of a <i>big powerful raising</i> agent!"
msgstr "Facile ! Mets-le au-dessus d'un <i>gros agent levant bien puissant</i> !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah! Like baking soda!"
msgstr "Ouais ! Comme le bicarbonate !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Feel like there's something I'm missing...?"
msgstr "J'ai l'impression qu'il y a un truc qui m'échappe...?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes. Yes, innocent. Like baking soda."
msgstr "Oui. Oui, petite âme. Comme le bicarbonate."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Because clearly I am not a delightfully witty dryer with an everpresent sexual consciousness... I am a baker."
msgstr "Parce que, de toute évidence, je ne suis pas un sèche-linge délicieusement spirituel doté d'une conscience sexuelle omniprésente... je suis un pâtissier."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And I was making a straightforward reference to baking."
msgstr "Et je faisais une référence toute simple à la pâtisserie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...huh?"
msgstr "...hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "It is a joke, cherub, that Washford and I used to make all the time when I could turn him away from his books and catch him on an episode of the Awesome English Oven Show..."
msgstr "C'est une blague, mon ange, que Washford et moi faisions tout le temps quand je parvenais à l'arracher à ses livres pour le coincer devant un épisode de l'émission Le Meilleur Four d'Angleterre..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "The bakers would be so confused when they had to work without yeast and Washford would turn to me and say if they had a raising agent as powerful as he was, their cakes would rise proudly, regardless of the ingredients."
msgstr "Les pâtissiers étaient si perplexes quand ils devaient travailler sans levure, et Washford se tournait vers moi pour dire que s'ils avaient un agent levant aussi puissant que le sien, leurs gâteaux lèveraient fièrement, quels que soient les ingrédients."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, I hear it now. Sex joke."
msgstr "Oh, je comprends maintenant. Blague sexuelle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a lil' double entendre that you did right there."
msgstr "C'est un petit double sens que tu nous as sorti là."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Just a teensy one."
msgstr "Tout petit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "An old joke?"
msgstr "Une vieille blague ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just as teensy as your love for Washford?"
msgstr "Aussi tout petit que ton amour pour Washford ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I wouldn't call it old. I would never call it old. But... finely aged, perhaps."
msgstr "Je ne dirais pas qu'elle est vieille. Je ne la dirais jamais vieille. Mais... vieillie en fût, peut-être."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-1/c-4/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You haven't talked to Washford in a while, huh?"
msgstr "Tu n'as pas parlé à Washford depuis un moment, hein ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-1/c-4/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You sound like you really miss him."
msgstr "On dirait qu'il te manque vraiment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-1/c-4/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh let's not sully this excellent time with pathos, good chum."
msgstr "Oh, ne ternissons pas ce moment excellent avec du pathos, mon brave."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-1/c-4/15/g-0/8 drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-1/c-5/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "More fun, more games, I say!"
msgstr "Plus de fun, plus de jeux, dis-je !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I have zero feeling for him!"
msgstr "Je n'éprouve absolument rien pour lui !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "He's the one who never comes when I call."
msgstr "C'est lui qui ne vient jamais quand je l'appelle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-1/c-5/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you continue to call him?"
msgstr "Mais tu continues à l'appeler ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b6/0/g-1/c-5/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Don't sully my pouting with your 'reason'!"
msgstr "Ne viens pas ternir ma bouderie avec ta « raison » !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b7/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "For god's sake no more asking me questions like this!"
msgstr "Pour l'amour du ciel, assez de questions comme ça !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b7/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Science is the <i>antithesis</i> of Dazzle."
msgstr "La science est l'<i>antithèse</i> de l'Éclat."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b7/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok, ok, I'm sorry, I'm kind of a science nerd."
msgstr "Bon, bon, pardon, je suis un peu fan de sciences."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b7/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm curious!"
msgstr "Ça m'intrigue !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b7/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You're forgiven. Barely."
msgstr "Pardon accordé. De justesse."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b7/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Out of curiosity, though, how many matching salt and pepper shaker sets do you have?"
msgstr "Par curiosité, combien de services salière-poivrière assortis as-tu ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b7/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you a big collector of dishware?"
msgstr "Tu es un grand collectionneur de vaisselle ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b7/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Too many. Without question."
msgstr "Trop. Sans l'ombre d'un doute."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b7/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But Washford always humors me when I see one I have to have."
msgstr "Mais Washford me passe toujours mes caprices quand j'en vois un que je dois avoir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b7/0/g-0/c-2/20
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "He says no, and I say please, and he says be reasonable and I say but look they're little pigs and he says I love you and I say thank you."
msgstr "Il dit non, et je dis s'il te plaît, et il dit sois raisonnable et je dis mais regarde ce sont des petits cochons et il dit je t'aime et je dis merci."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b7/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Shocking, I know! You'd think I'd just break most of it but such is my elegance and grace that I do in fact have a chipless and world-class collection of antique egg cups."
msgstr "Choquant, je sais ! On croirait que je casserais la plupart d'entre eux, mais telle est mon élégance et ma grâce que je possède en fait une collection de coquetiers anciens sans une seule ébréchure, digne des plus grands musées."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b7/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I fawn over them a bit too much perhaps, but Washford always encourages me."
msgstr "Je m'extasie peut-être un peu trop devant eux, mais Washford m'y encourage toujours."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b7/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "He gets such pleasure from how silly I become over these little things! You're adorable and I love you, he says!"
msgstr "Il prend tant de plaisir à me voir si ridicule devant ces petites choses ! Tu es adorable et je t'aime, dit-il !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b7/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Said."
msgstr "Disait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b7/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Sorry. Said I love you."
msgstr "Pardon. Disait « je t'aime »."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b7/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "My my my, perilously close to emotion on that one. You'd better ask me the next question before I say something I'll regret!"
msgstr "Mon dieu, mon dieu, mon dieu, périlleusement près de l'émotion, là. Tu ferais mieux de me poser la question suivante avant que je dise quelque chose que je regretterai !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can you tell me more about Washford?"
msgstr "Tu peux m'en dire plus sur Washford ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Has Washford been with you the whole time you've been in here?"
msgstr "Washford est-il avec toi depuis le début, depuis que tu es ici ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "He was my uh, partner in love for a brief, very brief, twenty-five year period. Next question!"
msgstr "Il était mon, euh, partenaire amoureux pendant une brève, très brève période de vingt-cinq ans. Question suivante !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well... of course, silly, we are stackables, after all..."
msgstr "Eh bien... évidemment, mon chou, nous sommes des Superposables, après tout..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "We are <i>not</i> brothers or anything incestuous as that - just a mere twenty-five year fling."
msgstr "Nous ne sommes <i>pas</i> frères ou quoi que ce soit d'aussi incestueux, juste une simple aventure de vingt-cinq ans."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's a long time, Drysdale."
msgstr "C'est long, Drysdale."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes yes, I suppose... hm. But time means less to me than to some others I know. It's been a blink of a timer setting, really."
msgstr "Oui oui, je suppose... hm. Mais le temps compte moins pour moi que pour d'autres que je connais. Ça a été un clin d'oeil sur un réglage de minuterie, vraiment."

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And how long has it been since you've broke up?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're a pretty lousy pretender, you know."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/g-1/c-3/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Years. Years! It's been years!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I was better at it in the beginning but it's been... so long..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/g-2/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How long since you've talked to him?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/g-2/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you still love him?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/g-2/c-5/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "A very long... lonely time."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And that must be the end of your game because it was by far the most important and tricky and insightful question, and since I answered all of them correctly, I win!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I love to win! Oh I love gold stars! I love Washford!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I love Washford."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1b8/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh, dammit."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Drysdale runs a hand through his hair, shaking his head."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh god. I can't tell you how inconvenient this is."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's inconvenient? You're in love."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. Believe me, pal, I get it."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You don't understand. To have a love like I have had, so deep, so..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ugh! It's infuriating. I'm trying to explain to you how I still love this character, this absurd amalgam of pathos and muscle and I don't have the words!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I sound like him with his searching and his verbosity, trying to describe how much I love and loathe his searching and his verbosity."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "What a circus. And not the good kind."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Do you? Truly? So many don't. Not that I've confessed or confided in anyone else in this linoleum gossip shop."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I think the consensus about Washford is that he's a wet nurse for pablum and that I'm better off."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Or it could be also that I'm a flighty and performative hot air balloon and HE'S better off but either way I just couldn't stand to hear it so I've never asked."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But if you really do understand the gross inconvenience represented by... true feeling for someone... then I am grateful."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You must do something for me. You can see now, I trust, that I am incapable of solving this puzzle on my own. I'm too bound up in it. And I have loved being bound up before, cherub, believe you me!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But this... dramatic pause... I am entangled. And you... you must help me."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What can I do?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We'll talk about the binding thing another time..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ah yes, I see the shimmer of curiosity in your eyes!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well, Washford and I found this silken robe tie and..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He trails off, lost in a precious memory. Eventually he sighs."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-0/c-3/34
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh Washford..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You must talk to him for me. You must, please, try to repair this... this chasm, this... this rift! It's like a new Stained Canyon has torn its way through my heart!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Will you? Please?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can try. I can't make any promises, though."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know. I'm not a therapist."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just want to know why you broke up."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Understood! I've always considered promises to be rather passe, anyway. Sort of just like beret hats. Just... you know, don't, really."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/c-4/15 drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/c-5/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I'm not asking you to be. I'm just asking for an open door."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Whether or not he and I can walk through it, or whether or not we even want to when we find ourselves there... that will be our affair."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/c-5/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok. You got it."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/c-5/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just don't want to. Sorry."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/c-5/23/c-0/18
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Dear Barbara I hope he's less aggravating now..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/c-5/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Huh. Well then. I don't suppose I can blame you..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/c-5/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh wait! Yes I can. Look at that, I have all the freedom to do anything I want! How fun."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/c-5/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "PBTBT"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ah... well that's for him to say."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "He's the one who left me."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_loves_washford/0/g-1/c-6/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I must go."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_third_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Mmmmyes?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_third_encounter/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You caught me at a time when I was... ummmm..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_third_encounter/0/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_third_encounter/0/32
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Sitting here like a lump! A big cube-y lump!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_third_encounter/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just came from talking with Washford."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_third_encounter/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll talk to Washford and see if we can't get you two back together."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_third_encounter/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You what?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_third_encounter/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Of course you did. He was probably just draped all over the floor, dripping emotions, he's an obvious one to ask if you're trying to accomplish something."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_third_encounter/0/c-0/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, he was a little mopey..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_third_encounter/0/c-0/29/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not trying to upset you, but I thought you should know."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_third_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Hm? Oh I don't want that... no, not at all."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_third_encounter/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But in the meantime I have nothing to speak to you about whatsoever."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_third_encounter/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Which is an interesting coincidence."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And what did Gilbert & Tragedy have to say?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, a lot."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Honestly, he talked a lot about you."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Really? And do you hate me now, too?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not at all. Neither does he."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Y'know you both ask that same question?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Pish, don't patronize me. You don't have the money."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Mean, but accurate. And he doesn't hate you."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, seemed like he misses you."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ha! Now I know you're lying. He was very clear the last time we spoke that he wanted nothing to do with me after... nevermind."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "After what?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Finally, am I going to get to understand this nonsense?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh please, he must've told you."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-3/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am rapidly coming to a place of not giving a crap with this."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-3/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He didn't, actually. Not specifically."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-3/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's about time I heard it, I think."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-3/c-8/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ah! I have so frequently visited that place myself, truth be told! But I'm very much here. You're free to go at any time!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-3/c-8/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Like now. Now is a time. Would you like to go?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-3/c-8/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kinda. I'll come back. But I need a break!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-3/c-8/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm just saying... y'all are a little frustrating."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-3/c-8/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "...so do I..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-3/c-8/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I know. Trust me, cherub, I know."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1f/0/g-3/c-8/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I'll get on with it then!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/4
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I don't like to tell this story. I don't know that I ever have, really. Washy called it 'The Pale Betrayal.'"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Washy?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aw, what a cute nickname!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Gasp! That was... it's only a nickname. I can't believe I've just used that with you. I was the only one who ever called him that and never in public... if I ever did he would purse his lips..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh sweet dryer sheet... never tell him I used that name in front of you. I wasn't even allowed to use it in a public place. He'd purse his lips if I did..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes! I saw him do that!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "It's unmistakable. But I did it anyway."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I loved his lips."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/g-0/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "His lips are gorgeous. Given."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/g-0/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So what happened?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "So, you've noticed them too. I thought I recognized a fellow addict. Ha, Lips Anonymous, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And as taken as I've always been by them, it wasn't enough."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/g-0/c-2/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "There's a young hormone around here named Dirk. Perhaps you've brushed up against him at some point?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I remember him... scrawny, kinda sexy."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't think I've met him yet. I'll look for him, though."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/g-1/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, we're lovers."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/g-1/c-5/18
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "My, you have more verve than I thought..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1g/0/g-1/c-5/26
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "...points..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "He is hard to miss."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/8/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "In any event. He has this habit of taking off his clothes. He wanders around, nearly nude, unbothered by the... by the, uh... temperature changes he engenders in others."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/8/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The hot boy made you hotter?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/8/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh shame on you, Drysdale. Come on."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Permanent press, darling..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I'm an appliance, not a monk."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "He used to do it so often that Washford and I took to using his clothes as part of our act."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "We could flip them and wring them and fold them whilst he was flipping and folding and wringing me... it was... it was... my god it was spectacular. I was spectacular."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But after years of doing this act with Washford, it began to grind on me. Washford can be very difficult."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And one being can only take so much from another before the pressure has to be released, the heat has to go somewhere!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What did you do?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This sounds like it's going in a bad direction..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well, we were in the middle of our act..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "We were using Dirk's red jeans and one of his chest-smushing polos and Dirk was just lying there, like he used to, dirty and shirtless and I had this brilliant idea of including him in the performance."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Including Dirk in your show? Without rehearsal or anything?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You didn't ask Washford, did you."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "It wasn't the most professional of ideas - sue me!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "No, I did not. Alright? We were in the middle of our performance! Do you think nature asked an opinion in the middle of creation?!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Dirk didn't have to do anything. I just struck up a conversation. It was this sexy, witty improvisatory repartee."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "He just kept saying the nicest things to me about our act, and my costume, and how much he liked the musculature of my shoulders..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "So I kept him talking and I refused to give him his clothes back."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you mean, refused?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Didn't you have to once the act was over?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is pretty hot. I get it."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I just didn't give them back, that's all."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh Innocent. You should have seen him glisten all naked. You wouldn't have given his clothes back either!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I mean, I would have, eventually, yes. But that was the genius bit!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I just kept our act going."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "The last part of the choreography was always Washford passing the clothes to me, and me then spinning them around and around, faster and faster..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "...building up all this tremendous heat, this anticipation, this breathlessness and then at the last second whipping them all out into the audience and letting the audience catch them, all hot and billowy."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "So I just kept talking to Dirk, and Washford was supposed to keep holding me and the clothes while Dirk got more and more colorful and I laughed and the audience laughed and screamed and it was... it was...!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-3/40
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "MY GOD IT WAS POETRY."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-3/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So the clothes... never got dry?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-3/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't believe you did all this without asking Washford."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I know, I know. Don't you think I know!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-3/c-10/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "In retrospect, yes. Of course it was... wrong."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-4/0 drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "They..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "The clothes stayed a little wet. They mildewed the tiniest bit."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "They made Washford... sick. He said he had a cough."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-4/32
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And afterwards, he called it 'The Pale Betrayal'."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-4/46
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "What a nonsense, dramatic exaggeration of the only good idea this act has seen in decades."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-4/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't get the \"Pale\" part."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-4/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sure Washford has had some good ideas, too."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-4/c-11/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Mildew is white, you see."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-4/c-11/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Sometimes grey."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-4/c-12/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh? Can you point to any?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-4/c-12/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He came up with the Pale Betrayal, that's pretty cool."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-4/c-12/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know him that well yet."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-4/c-12/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes. Marvelously original."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-4/c-12/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well before you get too excited about his creativity, The Pale Betrayal was the only thing he'd written in years. And it's not even terribly creative."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-5/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So he felt like you betrayed him by flirting with Dirk. In the middle of a performance."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-5/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think it's creative. The result of your betrayal was a pale mold."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-5/c-13/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes yes, I suppose so."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-5/c-14/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh mildew washes out. Please. He was more upset about the \"flirting.\""
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I was barely flirting, I would hardly qualify it like that. Dirk was just being nice! Washford was always so damned sensitive."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-6/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He's been this way for a long time?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-6/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But if you knew he was so sensitive, why did you flirt with Dirk?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-6/c-15/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "He's been this way since the day we met! It's infuriating!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1h/0/g-6/c-15/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hm. Sounds to me like he was being a little immature."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "It wasn't really flirting! He was being complimentary and I was playing along. If that's flirting, then I need practice."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I was performing! I was making our act better in the process, so what's the harm?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like you knew you were doing something uncool..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you knew how sensitive Washford was to your actions."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "...maybe I was being just the teensiest bit provocative."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "It's possible I was trying to irk him. Or get something out of him. Maybe."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And you loved Washford."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "...yes..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I loved him."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Dirk was just being so... nice to me..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you that much of a pushover?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nicer than Washford?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Pushover. Just what in hot and windy hell do you mean by pushover??"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You let a \"nice\" hottie distract you from your lover?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-0/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean that you're being a little casual."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-0/18/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Maybe. I..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-0/18/g-0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh I don't know why I did it. I don't know. I just felt so lonely."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-0/18/g-0/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Washy can be so hard to read sometimes, so... so incomprehensible. Where do I stand, what is he feeling and all that dreck."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-0/18/g-0/24
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And I acted out. Now I still feel lonely, but for totally opposing reasons which just seems... unfair."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "No, not nicer. Of course not. Just..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Washford can be so mysterious, you know. He can be very difficult to read. Sometimes I didn't know where I stood with him, or how he felt."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "It was just nice for once to be talking to someone whose every other word was how wonderful I am."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/31
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Dirk told me I had inspirational extension."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/39
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And I do."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/47
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You haven't seen it... but I'm basically one of those nesting ladders."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure. We'll go with that."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/55/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No idea what the hell you're talking about."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/55/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That makes sense actually..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/55/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "No one does..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/55/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "...points."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/55/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I didn't do anything wrong."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/55/g-0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I didn't mean to do anything wrong."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/55/g-0/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I just needed to know that Washford loved me."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1i/0/c-1/15/c-0/39/c-1/55/g-0/24
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I just needed him to say it, I suppose. That's all."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2b/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I KNOW. It's exhausting. It... it <i>was</i> exhausting, anyway."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2b/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "He hasn't exhausted me in years."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2b/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What happened between you two?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2b/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Mm. Sounds juicy."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2b/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh... I just don't think I can go into it. Heavy emotion is such a burden to an effervescent spirit."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2b/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't have to cry, or anything. We can just chat."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2b/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can come back another time, if you don't wanna talk about it now."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2b/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh chatting is just so tantalizingly close to real talk... why don't I just divulge, hm?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2b/0/g-0/c-3/11
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes, do that."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2b/0/g-0/c-3/19
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Perhaps next time I'll be more... inspired."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/3
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Precisely!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It sounds like it was just a misunderstanding."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you think Washford is over-reacting?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well OBVIOUSLY it was a misunderstanding."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "YES."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I react at precisely the right level every time!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Dirk is delicious but what am I going to do with him? He probably can't even do a cartwheel. That ridiculous hair of his would flop in his eyes and ruin his balance."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Washford's really talented, isn't he?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Washford is one of the best there has ever been."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "He's an artist."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "He's an idiot, but he's an artist."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can't expect him to just know things about you."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe his 'idiot' nature is something you could help him with - like a team?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Why? I don't think I'm unfathomable. I'm not like him and his 'depths' and his 'mystery.' I'm an open book."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "When I want to drink, I drink, when I want to eat, I eat."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "When I want to flirt with sexy naked boys who flirt back, that's what I do."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you'd rather flirt with Washford, right?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Of course I would."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Flirting with someone you love is the best feeling in the world."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/31/c-0/23/0/s/0 drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So maybe you should just tell him you're ready to treat him better."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/7 drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "That... seems so simple. I can't imagine why I hadn't thought of that. It must be all this wine."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "As in we complement each other - like a washer and a dryer?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ohh what a dull simile. I feel crafted out of construction paper and edible paste."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Dull or not - it's what you are."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh you're right. Maybe this was all stupid."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes... just... stupid."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You can... leave me be."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_2c/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I am good at being what I am."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1d/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's time for you and Washford to have a conversation with each other."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1d/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Maybe. It's an interesting suggestion. I'm not saying I'm convinced. I'm still hurt but also, I'm-I'm over it and I don't care and I don't really miss my former friend."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1d/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I mean, I do miss him. Desperately. But I'm not that easy. I mean, I don't want to be. I would so much rather be suave. Genuinely suave."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1d/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "...I've always wanted to be more mysterious than I am."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1d/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't have to be mysterious, Drysdale. You just have to be honest."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1d/0/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You sound like Washford."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1d/0/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "How do you know he even wants to be with me again?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1d/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He told me. He asked me to come and talk to you."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1d/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just have a feeling."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1d/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh, no."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1d/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Nothing. I just haven't cried in years."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/friend_1d/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Feelings are always worth going all in on."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me_2/0/4
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Call his name for me, would you?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me_2/0/12
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Call for Washford!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me_2/0/20
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Call his name!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me_2/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "'Washford!'"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Again!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me_2/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "'Washford!!'"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/17
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your calls are met with silence. No Washford."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/33
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And he does not arrive."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/41
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "It might be over, cherub."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/49
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I have some... drying out to do."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/call_washford_for_me_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/61
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Please leave me."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/Come_Back_Sometime_Drysdale/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And here we go!!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/Come_Back_Sometime_Drysdale/0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The show! Ah, the show... it is as though these two have not missed a single rehearsal. They are in perfect sync, their execution flawless and the tricks death-defying and beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/Come_Back_Sometime_Drysdale/0/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You can almost feel the love coursing off of them, carried in every bead of sweat, every particle of blesséd lint they release."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/Come_Back_Sometime_Drysdale/0/33
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As their show comes to its climactic conclusion, they ask, as you knew they would..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/Come_Back_Sometime_Drysdale/0/44
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "Join us? Dear one?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/Come_Back_Sometime_Drysdale/0/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Abso-freaking-lutely!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/Come_Back_Sometime_Drysdale/0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm good. You two are wonderful! I want to see it all!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/Come_Back_Sometime_Drysdale/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ah! Such courage. HA. I LOVE IT."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/Come_Back_Sometime_Drysdale/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "Of course. Come, Drydee... we must not disappoint!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/Come_Back_Sometime_Drysdale/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Time slows to a delicious crawl and you wish you could stay in this moment, with the lovers, forever."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_critical_encounter/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ah! Cherub. There you are."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_critical_encounter/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I am quite glad that you've returned; I've been sitting on some very big thoughts and I haven't had the opportunity to express them until now and... as you can imagine..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_critical_encounter/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "...sitting on anything big for a long period of time makes me ANTSY."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_critical_encounter/24/b/1
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And you even got me to weep openly which is something that only those with the most exclusive of backstage passes ever get to see."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_critical_encounter/24/b/9
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Points."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_critical_encounter/27
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "So. To begin. I've been thinking about you."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_path/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And I've been thinking that if I don't have you soon, and you don't do backflips about wanting me, then I might just die."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_path/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I was about to say of course I don't mean to be dramatic but who am I kidding of COURSE I mean to be dramatic. So. Dramatically. Will you have me?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_path/0/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And keep in mind that I am a HANDFUL so you'd be committing to something rather... rather sizable."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_path/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Drysdale, you are two hands full, and I am IN."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_path/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh believe me, I know! I'd rather have you as a good friend, though. Is that alright?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_path/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if we called Washford over instead?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_path/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well, spin my socks! Now THAT would be a love affair indeed!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Did you know... that you can be unbelievably annoying?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me?? Nah."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh yes. Frustrating to the point of nausea."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But I have to tell you... I like it."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I know! That expression on your face... I'm assuming it's shock, yes?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh, yes. Shock."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Closer to amusement."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, no, I have no reaction to what you just said."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh, good for me. I thought so."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Amusement... that would most likely have been my next guess."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "See? This is what I mean. NAUSEA."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I'm accustomed to seeing mostly awe, admiration, love, worship etc. on the faces of folk in my audience so I'm trying to get better at deciphering facial expressions that aren't that."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How good of you."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Excellent skill, right there."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Anyway. You're annoying, and I also like you, and I appreciate your... well, let's just call it what it is, friendship, so I'm wondering if you'd like to officially call yourself my friend."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lol. I'd love that. Let's do it!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks for liking me... but I kinda can't stand you. So. Nah, I'm good."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Do it we shall! The friendship, I mean. Nothing else. Or nothing more. Oh dear Barbara, you know what I mean!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You're good. As in, no friendship, thank you very much?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-2/c-8/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. No friendship."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-2/c-8/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See I can joke too!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-2/c-8/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ah. Well! I can't tell you how THRILLED I am to have wasted my precious, tight-glute energy on this deep-earth well of bullshit!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-2/c-8/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I would say good day, but I not-so-secretly hope you choke on a low-fat Beet Thin."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-2/c-8/15/c-0/26
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Begone, gnat!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-2/c-8/15/c-0/83 drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_path/0/g-0/60
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Now that's the kind of static that has no cling."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-2/c-8/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And so funny too."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-2/c-8/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well. I suppose I can take a good kicking in the ribs from time to time, friend."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_path/0/g-2/c-8/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Just don't... do it too much."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_friend/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I mean, of course. I feel compelled to tell you that you're missing out on a fantastic opportunity to be my lover because Dear BARBARA I am good at it..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_friend/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "But goodness me now that I've thought about it, I am also an exceptional friend. One of the best."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_friend/0/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "So yes! Of course it's alright! Lucky you, cherub!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_friend/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lol. Yep. Lucky me!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_friend/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your modesty is truly inspiring."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_friend/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh, I know. I know! It's one of the best things about me!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_path/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And I'm thinking that you're just about the dullest, most bone-dreary specimen I've ever come across..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_path/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And if I have to look at you very much longer I may rebel and scratch out my own eyes with a dryer ball to save myself the agony."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_path/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ouch?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_path/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey! I feel the same way about you! How cool!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_path/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ouch? That's your comeback?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_path/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "How reassuring to know that my instincts have once again led me to the correct conclusion."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_path/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You are a used dryer sheet. Limp and ineffectual."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_path/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And you know what we do with old dryer sheets, don't you, cherub?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_path/0/c-0/42
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "We throw them in the trash and slime them over with coffee grounds and smelly, mushy, dead bananas."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_path/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes! Yes, how cool! Isn't it wonderful we'd both kill the other given half a chance? What a delicious little happenstance."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_path/0/g-0/3
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Now get out. Before I make good. Toodles!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_return_solo/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Hello, you sauce pot! Looking quite saucy today, if I do say so... and I do!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_return_solo/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Is there something in particular I can drizzle you on? Or on you? I am an equal opportunity drizzler."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_return_solo/0/16/s/0 drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_return_solo/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've been thinking of getting you and Washford back together."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_return_solo/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Drysdale, I'm ready to Realize you!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_return_solo/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Of course I can, I have a powerful and mellifluous voice and I do know the word Washford..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_return_solo/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Wait. No. I can't. What are you suggesting? Is this cruelty??"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_return_solo/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You know I've tried! It is more and more painful every time he doesn't answer me... I'm not sure I can go through that again."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_return_solo/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Friend! Ooh. No, I don't like that at all. What a dull word."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_return_solo/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Chum? Compatriot? Ooh, familiar. I like that. A little bit of the dark and sensual."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_return_solo/0/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "What can I do for you, Familiar-mine?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_return_solo/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not a thing. Just wanted to say hi! Because you're... always interesting!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_return_solo/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How would you like to be Realized, Drysdale?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_return_solo/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ha! Oh, I am, aren't I? I'm so glad I can amuse and inspire that smile."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_return_solo/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yet another thing at which I excel, cherub! Ha! Points!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_friend_return_solo/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Washford does not answer me."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh, dear, you're back."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I'd better get my dryer ball ready..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you still hate me. Excellent. Just checking."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Drysdale, let's hold off on the gouging... I'm sorry. (USE CHARM CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh and a good thing, too. What if I'd changed my mind and you'd missed it."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Terrifying thought."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Sorry? You're sorry??"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Do you really think I will be placated by something as simple as a straightforward and heartfelt apology???"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well shit."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/c-1/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What? What happened?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/c-1/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cursing. That's new."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/c-1/39/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I have been placated by your straightforward and heartfelt apology."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/c-1/39/g-0/11
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "That's never happened before. I'm not entirely sure I like it."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/c-1/39/g-0/19
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I've never been moved before by less than a fully choreographed dance number with sequins and a smoke machine."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/c-1/39/g-0/27
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Sigh. I think I'm going soft."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/c-1/39/g-0/41
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Alright, alright. We're friends."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/c-1/39/g-0/52
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Now move along before my own generosity of spirit makes me do something stupid."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_hate_return/0/c-1/39/g-0/60
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Like HUG you, perish the thought. BLECH."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_sad/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ah, cherub. I've tried."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_sad/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "When I call him, he doesn't come. What can be done?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_sad/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll see what I can do."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_sad/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're right. I know you've tried. I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_sad/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Might be for nothing... but at least we have each other."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I fear I shall never speak to him again."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please try."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I dunno... I have a good feeling this time..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh alright."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Washford? Hullo.... oh Washford hear my cry..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh come on, you can do better than that!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It won't work if you don't mean it, Drysdale."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Fine! Pushy today, aren't we."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/g-0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Washfoooooorrrddddd!!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/g-0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He scoffs, hurt evident in his eyes."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/g-0/35
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "See! Nothing... nothing at—"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/g-0/46
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "Hello, Drysdale."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/g-0/54
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You've never seen Drysdale so lost for words. He looks positively taken aback."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/g-0/62
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I... Hello... I didn't think you'd come..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/g-0/70
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "I know. I didn't think I would either, truthfully."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/g-0/78
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "With so much water bearing up under our bridge, I thought the fire between us would long since have been drowned."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/g-0/86
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "But when I heard your voice..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/g-0/94
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "My voice?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/g-0/102
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "I couldn't resist."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/g-0/110
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh my darling. You never could resist my calling to you, could you?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/g-0/118
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "My being sings to the thunder of your merest whisper, my love."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/g-0/129
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh, hush. You flirt."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_climax/0/g-0/16/g-0/137
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh what am I saying, never hush. Flirt with me, forever!!!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is there any room for me in this sandwich?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It makes me so happy to see you two happy. I would be honored to be friends with you both!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You... you want to be included? Swept into this gorgeous maelstrom and carried along on the unknown tide?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "You sound like me, my love!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "So I do! Oh god. Is that a good thing?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-0/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It is if it means we can ALL be together!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-0/37/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, don't lose your own voice, I love how you talk!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-0/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "I thought my heart could get no fuller... but the promise of another bright and loving companion on our voyage is the glorious potential realized!!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-0/37/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh Washy. You've become so free-spirited!!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-0/37/c-0/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Of course you're welcome, cherub! We wouldn't have it any other way!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-0/37/c-0/31
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "And don't worry. I'll devise some sort of training regime to get you up to snuff so you can... keep up."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-0/37/c-0/39
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "Drydee... let's try not to frighten the poor initiate..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-0/37/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh it's just the heat of the moment, cherub! Not to worry."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-0/37/c-1/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "If anything, I think I shall become even more fully myself in the renewed nourishment of Washford's love!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-0/37/c-1/23
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "And a powerful tonic I shall be to you, Drydee... now and forever."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-0/37/c-1/31
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "If you would drink with us, dear one, then lift your glass."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-0/37/c-1/39
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "For tonight, we thirst for life!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "And we, dear one, are honored to have you."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "There is no poetry true enough for the gratitude that dwells in my heart for what you have done."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh, Washy, please, I've got just the thing to say!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "Do you now? My hole is being baited. I mean, my whole being is baited!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Cherub, I love you more than diamonds."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/50
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "...good god."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/58/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that... is that a lot?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/58/c-0/7
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "...yes."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/58/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "...yes."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/58/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nice."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/58/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh good. I truly could not think of a way to be more clear about that, Washy."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/58/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "Neither could I, my love. Very well done."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/58/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Dear friend, I hate to say it but... we're going to go, just for a bit."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/58/c-0/23/c-0/31
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "We have quite a lot to catch up on and... well..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/58/c-0/23/c-0/39
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "It's private. Thanks be to all that is holy, we have privacy to seek."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/58/c-0/23/c-0/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have fun, you two."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/58/c-0/23/c-0/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds good.... don't break anything!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/wd_post_climax/0/c-1/58/c-0/23/c-0/47/c-1/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Only boundaries!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Washy! Washy! Our cheeky monkey is back!!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_love_return/0/11
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "What a pleasure to see you once more, dear one."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_love_return/0/19
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "I assume you've returned for a reason?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_love_return/0/24
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "To see us, OBVIOUSLY. Forgive him, cherub, he can still be just the tiniest bit dense."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_love_return/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not a worry. I love his density. I did just come to say hello!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_love_return/0/33/s/0 drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_friend_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready to Realize both of you!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh how sweet!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_love_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I knew it."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_love_return/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "You knew it, Drydee."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_love_return/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "Consider your hello delivered and received with pleasure."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_love_return/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "A pleasure soon to be repeated, one dares to hope?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_love_return/0/c-0/47
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Two dare to hope, Washy. Come back soon!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ooh! Hello, there, cherub!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_friend_return/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Washy was just here... I think he's gone to write, let me get him for you..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_friend_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No no, it's ok, I just came to say hello!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_friend_return/0/c-0/10
msgctxt "Washford"
msgid "Welcome back. Forgive my absence... the muse is singing and like a syren she draws me ever onward."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_friend_return/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You'd better come back another time, cherub. I do love my machine, but he's been a fine sop all day."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_washford_friend_return/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You might get wet!!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realize_join_solo/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh FINALLY!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realize_join_solo/0/8
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You HAVE taken your sweet time, haven't you."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realize_join_solo/0/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Don't worry, my love, I'm not angry I'm just excited! And you surely by now know how expostulative I become when I'm... aroused!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realize_join_solo/0/24
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Well dear Barbara, cherub, why are we just standing here? Giddy-up!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realize_join_solo/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. I... maybe this is a bad idea... here we go!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realize_join_solo/0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's the Drysdale I love! Not quite ready yet, but I'll be back!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realize_join_solo/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh you WILL be back. I can't actually do a damned thing about it if you decide NOT to come back but..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realize_join_solo/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "... Oh do come back, cherub, I shall be devastated if you don't."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realize_return_solo/0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You're here! Oh yay. So. Shall we? I'm positively vibrating with anticipation!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realize_return_solo/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me, too! Vibrating is fun. Hold on tight!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realize_return_solo/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Almost! I promise I'll be ready soon!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realize_return_solo/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "My darling. I..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realize_return_solo/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "I haven't the energy to threaten or intimidate you right now, I'm saving my strength. But know this. Through this face that loves you, I am shooting an absolutely panic-inducing glare."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realize_begin_solo/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Let's see if we can Realize this high-flying hero!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realize_begin_solo/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Okay Drysdale - let's do one more spin cycle!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realize_begin_solo/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a dryer, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realized_solo/0/3
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh dear Barbara. LOOK at me!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realized_solo/0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Drysdale gives you a spin, capping it off with a cheeky little swat to his Glorious Marvelous."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realized_solo/0/19
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "You know, Washford used to tell me that I was the most beautiful thing he'd ever seen..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realized_solo/0/27
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "...and now I see my human form I think he might have been underselling!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realized_solo/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fabulous as always! I expected nothing less."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_realized_solo/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Drysdale, do me. Before I explode!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_divert_solo/0/3
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Ohhhoo, there's my cheeky little monkey!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_divert_solo/0/11
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "What if, in the doing of you, I <i>make</i> you explode? Because, cherub, that is a distinct possibility."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_divert_solo/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Great. Cool. YEP."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_divert_solo/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean... that would be even better, I'm pretty sure..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_divert_solo/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Wonderful! Then... no no! Cherub! What are you doing?!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_divert_solo/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Taking off my clothes?"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_divert_solo/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It says, \"baby oil, apply liberally.\""
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_divert_solo/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Oh sweetness no... that's my job. Me and these new chompers of mine!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_divert_solo/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "Yes, naive baby. <i>I</i> will apply it liberally to <i>you</i>."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_divert_solo/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Well. Goodness me."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_divert_solo/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There are some things even a narrator cannot describe... the acts that you and Drysdale commit together are the sort only spoken of in whispers in the darkest corners."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_divert_solo/0/g-1/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When all is said and done, you and Drysdale have made each other 'explode' countless times. It takes you days to recover."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_join_solo/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Drysdale made one hell of a splash when he landed like a glittering tidal wave on the outside world."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_join_solo/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A world he found depressingly music-less, drab and still."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_join_solo/16
msgctxt "Drysdale"
msgid "No one is dancing! Everyone's wearing brown! What the hell have I stumbled into!"
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_join_solo/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He found himself becoming quite angry, actually, until at long last he discovered JoJo's Bazaar: A Venture."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_join_solo/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It was a bar. And a cocktail lounge. But also a slightly disreputable dance hall..."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_join_solo/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "...and Drysdale quickly became its star. He turned the venture into one most capital - for his own wallet and the owners'."
msgstr ""

#: drysdale_dryer/drysdale_love_join_solo/48
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You can still see him there, even today; his favorite pole is the gold one, center stage."
msgstr ""
